{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0047","text":"Yesterday you were trembling for a health that is dear to you. To day you fear for your own. To morrow it will be anxiety about money the day after, to morrow the diatribe of a slanderer, the day after that the misfortune of some friend then the prevailing weather then something that has been broken or lost, then a pleasure with which your conscience and your vertebral column reproach you. Again, the course of public affairs.","audio_seconds":34.955,"processing_seconds":5.032,"windows":2,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[123,25],"mel_ms":[1349.833,1361.192],"encode_ms":[560.076,461.868],"decode_ms":[1557.708,1038.181]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0008","text":"But there is always a stronger sense of life when the sun is brilliant after rain. And now he is pouring down his beams and making sparkles among the wet straw, and lighting up every patch of vivid green moss on the red tiles of the cow shed, and turning even the muddy water that is hurrying along the channel to the drain into a mirror for the yellow billed ducks who are seizing the opportunity of getting a drink with as much body in it as possible.","audio_seconds":31.65,"processing_seconds":4.953,"windows":2,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[140,17],"mel_ms":[1078.682,1460.567],"encode_ms":[510.481,489.481],"decode_ms":[1744.01,1097.088]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-123859-0002","text":"But reckoning time, whose million'd accidents, creep in twixt vows, and change decrees of kings, Tan's sacred beauty, blunt the sharpest intense, Divert strong minds to the course of altering things. Alas, why fearing of time's tyranny? Might I not then say, Now I love you best, When I was certain o'er in certainty, Crowning the present, doubting of the rest of the colour.","audio_seconds":30.04,"processing_seconds":5.186,"windows":2,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[134,13],"mel_ms":[1222.866,1532.79],"encode_ms":[539.979,498.956],"decode_ms":[1728.072,1162.131]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0031","text":"So persuasive were her entreaties, and so strong her assurances that no harm whatever could result to them from the information she sought, they were induced to confess that one summer's night, the same she had mentioned, themselves and another friend being out on a stroll with Rodolfo, they had been concerned in the abduction of a girl whom Rodolfo carried off, whilst the rest of them detained her family, who made a great outcry and would have defended her if they could.","audio_seconds":28.42,"processing_seconds":3.783,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[151],"mel_ms":[1351.591],"encode_ms":[551.286],"decode_ms":[1851.016]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0032","text":"He must descend with his heart full of charity and severity at the same time, as a brother and as a judge, to those impenetrable casemates, where crawl pell-mell those who bleed and those who deal the blow, those who weep and those who curse, those who fast and those who devour, those who endure evil and those who inflict it.","audio_seconds":28.09,"processing_seconds":3.759,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[113],"mel_ms":[1431.618],"encode_ms":[609.927],"decode_ms":[1692.403]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274381-0005","text":"Dreading the superior power of Argyle, who, having joined his vassals to a force levied by the public, was approaching with a considerable army. Montrose hastened northward in order to rouse again the Marquis of Huntley and the Gordons, who, having before hastily taken arms, had been instantly suppressed by the covenanters.","audio_seconds":26.16,"processing_seconds":4.039,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[113],"mel_ms":[1557.239],"encode_ms":[671.838],"decode_ms":[1781.667]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0028","text":"There was infinite skepticism around him on the subject, and while other inventors were also giving the subject their thought, the public took it for granted that anything so utterly intangible as electricity that could not be seen or weighed and only gave secondary evidence of itself at the exact point of use could not be brought to accurate registration.","audio_seconds":25.94,"processing_seconds":4.243,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[113],"mel_ms":[1736.34],"encode_ms":[675.814],"decode_ms":[1803.08]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-123859-0001","text":"Oh, tis the first, tis flattery in my seeing, and my great mind most kingly drinks it up. Mine eye well knows what with his gust is green, and to his palate doth prepare the cup. If it be poisoned, tis the lesser sin that mine eye loves it and doth first begin.","audio_seconds":25.395,"processing_seconds":4.277,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[89],"mel_ms":[1731.718],"encode_ms":[675.015],"decode_ms":[1843.258]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0043","text":"Of course, the words, this has existed before, are a very inadequate translation of what actually happens when we form a judgment of recognition, but that is unavoidable. Words are framed to express a level of thought which is by no means primitive, and are quite incapable of expressing such an elementary occurrence as recognition.","audio_seconds":24.485,"processing_seconds":4.528,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[111],"mel_ms":[1823.795],"encode_ms":[716.129],"decode_ms":[1959.164]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0006","text":"Sylvia did not think that her good conduct was a merit, for she knew that she was virtuous only because her self-love compelled her to be so, and she never exhibited any pride or assumed any superiority towards her theatrical sisters. Although satisfied to shine by their talent or their beauty, they cared little about rendering themselves conspicuous by their virtue.","audio_seconds":23.74,"processing_seconds":4.859,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[119],"mel_ms":[1968.539],"encode_ms":[757.817],"decode_ms":[2101.612]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-75918-0003","text":"From the respect paid her on all sides she seemed like a queen, and from the adoration with which she was treated by two or three, she appeared an object of worship. The Queen Mother gave the French the most affectionate reception. France was her native country, and she had suffered too much unhappiness in England for England to have made her forget France.","audio_seconds":23.315,"processing_seconds":4.844,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[121],"mel_ms":[1961.327],"encode_ms":[750.022],"decode_ms":[2103.88]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0000","text":"It is a very fine old place of red brick, softened by a pale, powdery lichen, which has dispersed itself with happy irregularity, so as to bring the red brick into terms of friendly companionship with the limestone ornaments surrounding the three gables, the windows, and the doorplace.","audio_seconds":22.57,"processing_seconds":4.634,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[102],"mel_ms":[1943.848],"encode_ms":[746.882],"decode_ms":[1916.077]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274384-0011","text":"The English, it is evident, had they not been previously assured of receiving the king, would never have parted with so considerable a sum, and while they weakened themselves by the same measure, they have strengthened a people with whom they must afterwards have so material an interest to discuss.","audio_seconds":22.36,"processing_seconds":4.604,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[93],"mel_ms":[1967.657],"encode_ms":[755.71],"decode_ms":[1854.749]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13754-0012","text":"This meant that for an alleged misdemeanor, for which Congress prescribed a maximum penalty of six months' imprisonment and a fine of three hundred dollars, a man might be imprisoned for life, aye, for many terms of a man's natural life, did the court's power to enforce its sentences extend so far, and might be fined millions of dollars.","audio_seconds":22.095,"processing_seconds":4.942,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[119],"mel_ms":[1949.045],"encode_ms":[749.53],"decode_ms":[2213.335]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-287645-0007","text":"Another case, said John Wesley, was a little girl, half grown, who was washing windows upstairs one day, and unluckily fell asleep in the window, and in this position was found by her mistress. In a rage, the mistress hit her a heavy slap, knocked her out of the window, and she fell to the pavement, and died in a few hours from the effects thereof.","audio_seconds":21.5,"processing_seconds":5.046,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[126],"mel_ms":[1967.49],"encode_ms":[748.841],"decode_ms":[2302.263]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0011","text":"Beholding it, Hester was constrained to rush towards the child, to pursue the little elf in the flight which she invariably began, to snatch her to her bosom with a close pressure and earnest kisses, not so much from overflowing love as to assure herself that Pearl was flesh and blood and not utterly delusive.","audio_seconds":21.345,"processing_seconds":4.839,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[108],"mel_ms":[1955.692],"encode_ms":[756.256],"decode_ms":[2101.64]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28241-0001","text":"After an apprenticeship on a merchant ship, he had entered the Imperial Navy, and had already reached the rank of lieutenant when the Count appointed him to the charge of his own private yacht, in which he was accustomed to spend by far the greater part of his time. Throughout the winter, generally cruising in the Mediterranean, whilst in the summer he visited more northern waters.","audio_seconds":21.015,"processing_seconds":5.1,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[132],"mel_ms":[1967.139],"encode_ms":[746.953],"decode_ms":[2355.478]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0019","text":"The mystery of their origin, their capacity for evolving latent faculties of crime, and the steady vitality with which they survive the hearse and speak their deep-mouthed malignities in every newborn generation, have associated them somehow in my mind with a spell of life exceeding and distinct from human and a special satanic action.","audio_seconds":20.855,"processing_seconds":4.836,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[106],"mel_ms":[1942.256],"encode_ms":[750.195],"decode_ms":[2116.406]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274384-0004","text":"And the men of Israel answered the men of Judah and said, We have ten parts in the king, and we have also more right in David than ye. Why then did ye despise us that our advice should not be first had in bringing back our king?","audio_seconds":20.64,"processing_seconds":4.39,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[70],"mel_ms":[1937.423],"encode_ms":[749.723],"decode_ms":[1680.752]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-960-0010","text":"But he has not as yet defined this intermediate territory, which lies somewhere between medicine and mathematics, and he would have felt that there was as great an impiety in ranking theories of physics first in the order of knowledge as in placing the body before the soul.","audio_seconds":20.46,"processing_seconds":4.564,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[90],"mel_ms":[1956.975],"encode_ms":[749.493],"decode_ms":[1831.673]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0032","text":"The Free State Hotel, a stone building in dimensions fifty by seventy feet, three stories high and handsomely furnished, previously occupied only for lodging rooms, on that day for the first time opened its table accommodations to the public and provided a free dinner in honor of the occasion.","audio_seconds":20.28,"processing_seconds":4.842,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[100],"mel_ms":[1938.462],"encode_ms":[750.224],"decode_ms":[2124.802]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0026","text":"When the music, by its bursts of melody, carried away these illustrious dancers, when the simple, untutored pantomime of that period, only the more natural on account of the very indifferent acting of the august actors had reached its culminating point of triumph, the theatre shook with tumultuous applause.","audio_seconds":20.15,"processing_seconds":4.844,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[107],"mel_ms":[1951.399],"encode_ms":[754.513],"decode_ms":[2111.065]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0005","text":"The man of the household also can do something in this direction, and indeed he commonly does, but with a still lower descent into the levels of indigence along the margin of the slums, the man and presently also the children virtually cease to consume valuable goods for appearances, and the woman remains virtually the sole exponent of the household's pecuniary decency.","audio_seconds":20.03,"processing_seconds":5.045,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[121],"mel_ms":[1938.708],"encode_ms":[750.867],"decode_ms":[2330.137]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0002","text":"And therefore, to you I turn, Timaeus, citizen of Locris, who are at once a philosopher and a statesman, and to you, Critias, whom all Athenians know to be similarly accomplished, and to Hermocrates, who is also fitted by nature and education to share in our discourse.","audio_seconds":19.99,"processing_seconds":4.819,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[102],"mel_ms":[1939.011],"encode_ms":[753.288],"decode_ms":[2101.87]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13754-0008","text":"It has been my privilege to tread the soil of many lands, to observe the customs and study the habits of more nations than one, and I have yet to find the place and meet the people where and with whom the purity of man and woman is held more precious than among the maligned Mormons in the mountain valleys of the West.","audio_seconds":19.91,"processing_seconds":4.762,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[97],"mel_ms":[1958.505],"encode_ms":[755.689],"decode_ms":[2023.039]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0003","text":"For general service, therefore, requiring no special effort, the numerical strength of the factions was about equal, while on extraordinary occasions the two thousand border ruffian reserve lying a little farther back from the state line could at any time easily turn the scale.","audio_seconds":19.8050625,"processing_seconds":4.661,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[91],"mel_ms":[1940.187],"encode_ms":[754.872],"decode_ms":[1943.377]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0000","text":"At the conclusion of the banquet, which was served at five o'clock, the king entered his cabinet, where his tailors were awaiting him for the purpose of trying on the celebrated costume representing spring, which was the result of so much imagination and had cost so many efforts of thought to the designers and ornament workers of the court.","audio_seconds":19.475,"processing_seconds":4.848,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[110],"mel_ms":[1935.072],"encode_ms":[750.692],"decode_ms":[2140.026]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0028","text":"Well then, last, here is Turner's, Greek school of the highest class, and you define his art absolutely, as first the displaying intensely and with the sternest intellect of natural form as it is, and then the envelopment of it with cloud and fire.","audio_seconds":19.005,"processing_seconds":4.665,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[80],"mel_ms":[1974.75],"encode_ms":[753.882],"decode_ms":[1914.929]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36377-0021","text":"Envy, hatred, malice, and uncharitableness are never so essentially detestable to my mind as when they are animated by the sense of propriety and work under the surface. But for my interest in Naomi and my other interest in the little love looks which I now and then surprised passing between her and Ambrose, I should never have sat through that supper.","audio_seconds":18.87,"processing_seconds":4.932,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[104],"mel_ms":[1960.055],"encode_ms":[757.397],"decode_ms":[2188.783]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0009","text":"All dissent, all noncompliance, all hesitation, all mere silence, even, were in their stronghold towns, like Leavenworth, branded as abolitionism, declared to be hostility to the public welfare, and punished with proscription, personal violence, expulsion, and frequently death.","audio_seconds":18.56,"processing_seconds":4.808,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[96],"mel_ms":[1981.996],"encode_ms":[749.884],"decode_ms":[2054.765]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79740-0008","text":"For instance, one day the children had been playing upon the piazza with blocks and other playthings, and finally had gone into the house, leaving all the things on the floor of the piazza instead of putting them away in their places, as they ought to have done.","audio_seconds":18.415,"processing_seconds":4.683,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[84],"mel_ms":[1965.702],"encode_ms":[759.464],"decode_ms":[1936.788]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0001","text":"Had Eva Cressweller not been good looking? Had Jack been still at college? Had Sir Kennington Oval remained in England? Had Mr. Bunnet and the barkeeper not succeeded in stopping my carriage on the hill? Should I have succeeded in arranging for the final departure of my old friend?","audio_seconds":18.125,"processing_seconds":4.925,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[102],"mel_ms":[1966.343],"encode_ms":[762.476],"decode_ms":[2172.381]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0002","text":"By being studious of color, they are studious of division, and while the curoscurist devotes himself to the representation of degrees of force in one thing, unseparated light, the colorists have for their function the attainment of beauty by arrangement of the divisions of light.","audio_seconds":17.96,"processing_seconds":4.725,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[93],"mel_ms":[1946.1],"encode_ms":[747.608],"decode_ms":[2005.218]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274381-0017","text":"Historians, at least, perhaps from their own ignorance and inexperience, have not remarked anything but a headlong impetuous conduct, each party hurrying to a battle where valor and fortune chiefly determined the success.","audio_seconds":17.825,"processing_seconds":4.662,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[79],"mel_ms":[1957.613],"encode_ms":[757.481],"decode_ms":[1926.003]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-123852-0000","text":"Those pretty wrongs that liberty commits, when I am some time absent from thy heart, thy beauty and thy years full well befits, for still temptation follows where thou art.","audio_seconds":17.695,"processing_seconds":4.426,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[59],"mel_ms":[1952.809],"encode_ms":[758.54],"decode_ms":[1695.858]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0023","text":"A slight diminution in the excessively high temperature which had prevailed for the last few weeks was the only apparent change in the general order of things, but whether this was to be attributed to any alteration in the Earth's orbit was a question which would still require several days to decide.","audio_seconds":17.57,"processing_seconds":4.788,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[96],"mel_ms":[1951.393],"encode_ms":[746.57],"decode_ms":[2067.356]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28241-0004","text":"Although only a moderate breeze was blowing, the sea was rough, a circumstance to be accounted for only by the diminution in the force of the earth's attraction, rendering the liquid particles so buoyant, that by the mere effect of oscillation they were carried to a height that was quite unprecedented.","audio_seconds":17.415,"processing_seconds":4.865,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[102],"mel_ms":[1945.632],"encode_ms":[763.955],"decode_ms":[2132.693]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-123852-0002","text":"No matter then, although my foot did stand upon the farthest earth, removed from thee, for nimble thought can jump both sea and land, as soon as think the place where he would be, but ah","audio_seconds":17.285,"processing_seconds":4.76,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[60],"mel_ms":[2050.091],"encode_ms":[785.726],"decode_ms":[1905.325]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0044","text":"Harry was placed in the custody of Captain Martin of the Kickapoo Rangers, who proved a kind jailer, and materially assisted in protecting him from the dangerous intentions of the mob which at that time held Leavenworth under the reign of terror.","audio_seconds":17.105,"processing_seconds":4.776,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[79],"mel_ms":[2051.791],"encode_ms":[782.977],"decode_ms":[1918.384]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0009","text":"Our confidence or lack of confidence in the accuracy of a memory image must, in fundamental cases, be based upon a characteristic of the image itself, since we cannot evoke the past bodily and compare it with the present image.","audio_seconds":16.91,"processing_seconds":4.759,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[78],"mel_ms":[2024.021],"encode_ms":[782.184],"decode_ms":[1931.482]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0026","text":"P.S. Pray, sir, excuse me for writing to you a second time. I could not help writing, partly to tell you how thankful I am for your kindness, and partly to let you know that your advice shall not be wasted, however sorrowfully and reluctantly it may be at first followed. CB","audio_seconds":16.735,"processing_seconds":5.158,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[94],"mel_ms":[2038.14],"encode_ms":[788.846],"decode_ms":[2309.502]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0001","text":"God, as a direct consequence of the sin which man thus punished, had given her a lovely child, whose place was on that same dishonored bosom to connect her parent forever with the race and descent of mortals, and to be finally a blessed soul in heaven.","audio_seconds":16.715,"processing_seconds":4.859,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[85],"mel_ms":[2057.382],"encode_ms":[781.699],"decode_ms":[1995.644]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0005","text":"Hester could only account for the child's character, and even then most vaguely and imperfectly, by recalling what she herself had been during that momentous period, while Pearl was imbibing her soul from the spiritual world and her bodily frame from its material of earth.","audio_seconds":16.645,"processing_seconds":5.096,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[87],"mel_ms":[2043.899],"encode_ms":[832.504],"decode_ms":[2198.06]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0073","text":"This attitude springs from a false conception of sin, the conception that sin is a small matter, easily taken care of by good works, that we must present ourselves unto God with a good conscience, that we must feel no sin before we may feel that Christ was given for our sins.","audio_seconds":16.56,"processing_seconds":5.168,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[88],"mel_ms":[2134.113],"encode_ms":[831.04],"decode_ms":[2179.124]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0004","text":"Her face was an enigma, for it inspired everyone with the warmest sympathy, and yet if you examined it attentively, there was not one beautiful feature. She could not be called handsome, but no one could have thought her ugly.","audio_seconds":16.46,"processing_seconds":5.092,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[76],"mel_ms":[2174.819],"encode_ms":[829.448],"decode_ms":[2063.231]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-123852-0004","text":"My heart doth plead that thou in him dost lie, A closet never pierced with crystal eyes, but the defendant doth that plea deny, And says in him thy fair appearance lies.","audio_seconds":16.29,"processing_seconds":4.873,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[61],"mel_ms":[2173.412],"encode_ms":[829.328],"decode_ms":[1850.5]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0016","text":"This, I felt, was paid to me as being president of the republic, and I endeavored to behave myself with such mingled humility and dignity as might befit the occasion. But I could not but feel that something was wanting to the simplicity of my ordinary life.","audio_seconds":16.2399375,"processing_seconds":5.173,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[84],"mel_ms":[2170.966],"encode_ms":[845.11],"decode_ms":[2131.738]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3979-0001","text":"The condition is that I will be permitted to make Luther talk American. Streamline him, so to speak, because you will never get people, whether in or outside the Lutheran Church, actually to read Luther unless we make him talk as he would talk today to Americans.","audio_seconds":16.1250625,"processing_seconds":5.193,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[85],"mel_ms":[2190.818],"encode_ms":[825.341],"decode_ms":[2155.672]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0028","text":"By degrees all his happiness, all his brilliancy, subsided into regret and uneasiness, so that his limbs lost their power, his arms hung heavily by his sides, and his head drooped as though he was stupefied.","audio_seconds":16.075,"processing_seconds":5.048,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[74],"mel_ms":[2187.083],"encode_ms":[833.97],"decode_ms":[2004.673]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0014","text":"If it be granted, first, that the thoughts of a certain character should be known to the audience, and secondly, that soliloquy, or the habit of thinking aloud, is in opposition to modern stage technique, how shall a soliloquy be avoided without damage to the play?","audio_seconds":16.02,"processing_seconds":5.235,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[95],"mel_ms":[2187.901],"encode_ms":[814.866],"decode_ms":[2210.147]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0011","text":"But when it came to be a question of lighting a scattered suburb, a group of dwellings on the outskirts, a remote country residence, or a farmhouse, the alternating current in all elements, save its danger, was and is ideal.","audio_seconds":15.875,"processing_seconds":5.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[83],"mel_ms":[2177.849],"encode_ms":[829.642],"decode_ms":[2090.882]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0025","text":"It is to let Hamlet, if that happened to be the name of your character, enter with a small dog, petfalcon, mongoose, tame bear, or whatever animal is most in keeping with the part, and confide in this animal such sorrows, hopes, or secret history as the audience has got to know.","audio_seconds":15.74,"processing_seconds":5.281,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[95],"mel_ms":[2181.437],"encode_ms":[826.601],"decode_ms":[2247.686]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0002","text":"For it is a solid, heavy, handsome door, and must once have been in the habit of shutting with a sonorous bang behind the liveried lackey who had just seen his master and mistress off the grounds in a carriage and pair.","audio_seconds":15.52,"processing_seconds":5.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[74],"mel_ms":[2191.071],"encode_ms":[837.346],"decode_ms":[2070.29]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0039","text":"One perceives without understanding it a hideous murmur, sounding almost like human accents, but more nearly resembling a howl than an articulate word.","audio_seconds":15.42,"processing_seconds":4.841,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[2181.003],"encode_ms":[833.592],"decode_ms":[1806.31]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0042","text":"But they dragged him out of the room and up the stairs into the loft, and here, in a dark corner, where no daylight could enter, they left him.","audio_seconds":15.31,"processing_seconds":4.928,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[2187.048],"encode_ms":[830.752],"decode_ms":[1893.475]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0016","text":"With many variations, suggested by the nature of his building materials, diversity of climate, and a different mode of social life, Governor Bellingham had planned his new habitation after the residences of gentlemen of fair estate in his native land.","audio_seconds":15.255,"processing_seconds":5.255,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[82],"mel_ms":[2170.197],"encode_ms":[851.345],"decode_ms":[2212.712]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0011","text":"They are beyond all other works that I know existing, dependent for their effect on low, subdued tones, their favorite choice in time of day being either dawn or twilight, and even their brightest sunsets produced chiefly out of gray paper.","audio_seconds":15.19,"processing_seconds":5.081,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[76],"mel_ms":[2173.669],"encode_ms":[836.719],"decode_ms":[2051.809]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0017","text":"Sheriff Jones had his pockets always full of writs issued in the spirit of persecution, but was often baffled by the sharp wits and ready resources of the Free State people, and sometimes defied outright.","audio_seconds":15.11,"processing_seconds":5.021,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[72],"mel_ms":[2196.611],"encode_ms":[832.486],"decode_ms":[1969.56]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0010","text":"It was a look so intelligent, yet inexplicable, perverse, sometimes so malicious, but generally accompanied by a wild flow of spirits that Hester could not help questioning at such moments whether Pearl was a human child.","audio_seconds":15.05,"processing_seconds":5.132,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[75],"mel_ms":[2204.817],"encode_ms":[838.681],"decode_ms":[2068.523]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0019","text":"You must know, said Margolot, when they were all seated together on the broad window seat, that my husband foolishly gave away all the powder of life he first made to old Momby the Witch, who used to live in the country of the Gillikins, to the north of here.","audio_seconds":15.025,"processing_seconds":5.424,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[91],"mel_ms":[2178.876],"encode_ms":[843.894],"decode_ms":[2377.332]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134691-0008","text":"The uncouth faces passed him two by two, stained yellow or red, or livid by the sea, and as he strove to look at them with ease and indifference, a faint stain of personal shame and commiseration rose to his own face.","audio_seconds":14.985,"processing_seconds":5.01,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[72],"mel_ms":[2171.975],"encode_ms":[830.436],"decode_ms":[1987.422]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0019","text":"The strong position held by the Edison system under the strenuous competition that was already springing up was enormously improved by the introduction of a three-wire system, and it gave an immediate impetus to incandescent lighting.","audio_seconds":14.82,"processing_seconds":5.023,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[73],"mel_ms":[2140.633],"encode_ms":[834.16],"decode_ms":[2029.116]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0012","text":"It is also noticeable that the serviceability of consumption as a means of repute, as well as the insistence on it as an element of decency, is at its best in those portions of the community where the human contact of the individual is widest and the mobility of the population is greatest.","audio_seconds":14.76,"processing_seconds":5.243,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[85],"mel_ms":[2196.234],"encode_ms":[838.182],"decode_ms":[2182.827]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0003","text":"A large open fireplace with rusty dogs in it, and a bare boarded floor. At the far end, fleeces of wool stacked up. In the middle of the floor, some empty corn bags.","audio_seconds":14.675,"processing_seconds":5.014,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[66],"mel_ms":[2173.907],"encode_ms":[830.307],"decode_ms":[1988.525]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0001","text":"The London plant was less temporary, but not permanent, supplying, before it was torn out, no fewer than three thousand lamps in hotels, churches, stores, and dwellings in the vicinity of Holborn Viaduct.","audio_seconds":14.63,"processing_seconds":5.191,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[74],"mel_ms":[2189.865],"encode_ms":[837.886],"decode_ms":[2140.249]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32879-0017","text":"Of Mark Wilder, I say this his name has been for years hateful to me, and recently it has become frightful, and you will promise me simply this that you will never ask me to speak again about him.","audio_seconds":14.59,"processing_seconds":4.933,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[64],"mel_ms":[2181.777],"encode_ms":[828.738],"decode_ms":[1901.274]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0034","text":"Whenever the sense of familiarity occurs without a definite object, it leads us to search the environment until we are satisfied that we have found the appropriate object, which leads us to the judgment. This is familiar.","audio_seconds":14.51,"processing_seconds":5.154,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[79],"mel_ms":[2177.648],"encode_ms":[830.478],"decode_ms":[2123.945]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0021","text":"The painter who says my grinder. The notary who says my skip the gutter. The hairdresser who says my mealy back. The cobbler who says my cub talks slang.","audio_seconds":14.48,"processing_seconds":5.054,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[54],"mel_ms":[2188.959],"encode_ms":[827.148],"decode_ms":[2018.303]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0015","text":"But do not suppose that I disparage the gift which you possess, nor that I would discourage you from exercising it. I only exhort you so to think of it and so to use it, as to render it conducive to your own permanent good.","audio_seconds":14.425,"processing_seconds":5.05,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[2140.474],"encode_ms":[838.709],"decode_ms":[2049.808]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0039","text":"when she came to her senses, and blushing to find herself in Rodolfo's arms, would have disengaged herself. No, Signora, he said, that must not be. Strive not to withdraw from the arms of him who holds you in his soul.","audio_seconds":14.375,"processing_seconds":5.016,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[78],"mel_ms":[2091.779],"encode_ms":[811.024],"decode_ms":[2092.997]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0031","text":"And then we insist upon it, the study of social deformities and infirmities, and the task of pointing them out with a view to remedy, is not a business in which choice is permitted.","audio_seconds":14.31,"processing_seconds":4.705,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[2107.796],"encode_ms":[810.545],"decode_ms":[1767.134]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0007","text":"The brown ground beneath is left for the most part. One touch of black is put for the hollow, two delicate lines of dark gray define the outer curve, and one little quivering touch of white draws the inner edge of the mandible.","audio_seconds":14.24,"processing_seconds":3.579,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[75],"mel_ms":[1614.656],"encode_ms":[458.333],"decode_ms":[1485.333]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-134647-0007","text":"Proscribed by the civil and ecclesiastical powers of the empire, the Donatists still maintained in some provinces, particularly in Numidia, their superior numbers, and 400 bishops acknowledged the jurisdiction of their primate.","audio_seconds":14.17,"processing_seconds":3.964,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[85],"mel_ms":[1078.389],"encode_ms":[651.202],"decode_ms":[2220.707]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-31957-0022","text":"Then I, long tried by natural ills, received the comfort fast, while budding. At thy sight my pilgrim's staff gave out green leaves with morning dews imperled.","audio_seconds":14.1,"processing_seconds":4.017,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[59],"mel_ms":[1696.035],"encode_ms":[662.125],"decode_ms":[1642.32]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0021","text":"It will be wholly impossible for you to retain the tranquility of temper and felicity of faith necessary for noble purest painting unless you are actively engaged in promoting the felicity and peace of practical life.","audio_seconds":14.02,"processing_seconds":4.943,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[2112.936],"encode_ms":[815.847],"decode_ms":[1994.542]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0026","text":"There, too, were large easy chairs, silken sofas, large tables full of picture books and full of toys worth hundreds and hundreds of crowns. At least the children said so.","audio_seconds":13.96,"processing_seconds":3.603,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[63],"mel_ms":[1949.002],"encode_ms":[496.933],"decode_ms":[1141.053]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0019","text":"The large letter contains, indeed, entirely feeble and ill-drawn figures. That is merely childish and failing work of an inferior hand. It is not characteristic of Gothic or any other school.","audio_seconds":13.93,"processing_seconds":3.075,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[65],"mel_ms":[1035.176],"encode_ms":[452.544],"decode_ms":[1573.58]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0019","text":"The sentence of St. James, which says that he who offends against one commandment becomes guilty of all, had seemed to him first a swollen phrase until he had begun to grope in the darkness of his own state.","audio_seconds":13.895,"processing_seconds":4.968,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[2101.981],"encode_ms":[835.463],"decode_ms":[2011.575]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0027","text":"He had for his own town residence a big house filled with the spoils of travel and the trophies of the chase. But it was to his country home, an old family place in Essex, that he wished her immediately to proceed.","audio_seconds":13.87,"processing_seconds":5.02,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[74],"mel_ms":[2085.932],"encode_ms":[842.268],"decode_ms":[2072.442]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0003","text":"The child had a native grace which does not invariably coexist with faultless beauty. Its attire, however simple, always impressed the beholder as if it were the very garb that precisely became it best.","audio_seconds":13.72,"processing_seconds":4.933,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[2095.987],"encode_ms":[809.831],"decode_ms":[2006.944]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0022","text":"Time rolled on. The hour of her delivery arrived. It took place in the utmost secrecy. Her mother taking upon her the office of midwife, as she gave birth to a son, one of the most beautiful ever seen.","audio_seconds":13.645,"processing_seconds":4.891,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[70],"mel_ms":[2086.894],"encode_ms":[808.868],"decode_ms":[1976.241]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274381-0013","text":"From the same men, new regiments and new companies were formed, different officers appointed, and the whole military force put into such hands as the independents could rely on.","audio_seconds":13.61,"processing_seconds":4.797,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[2105.601],"encode_ms":[825.369],"decode_ms":[1848.067]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122612-0000","text":"Since the period of our tale, the active spirit of the country has surrounded it with a belt of rich and thriving settlements, though none but the hunter or the savage is ever known even now to penetrate its wild recesses.","audio_seconds":13.48,"processing_seconds":5.057,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[74],"mel_ms":[2095.594],"encode_ms":[804.771],"decode_ms":[2137.719]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0001","text":"Another and far more important reason than the delivery of a pair of embroidered gloves impelled Hester at this time to seek an interview with a personage of so much power and activity in the affairs of the settlement.","audio_seconds":13.43,"processing_seconds":4.962,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[65],"mel_ms":[2101.701],"encode_ms":[806.296],"decode_ms":[2036.338]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284449-0017","text":"When first they entered the throne room, they tried to be as haughty and scornful as ever, but the blues who were assembled there all laughed at them and jeered them, for there was not a single person in all the blue country who loved the princesses the least little bit.","audio_seconds":13.335,"processing_seconds":5.198,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[86],"mel_ms":[2092.405],"encode_ms":[805.418],"decode_ms":[2279.427]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0023","text":"Why was the sacrament of the Eucharist instituted under the two species of bread and wine if Jesus Christ be present body and blood, soul and divinity, in the bread alone and in the wine alone?","audio_seconds":13.275,"processing_seconds":4.894,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[63],"mel_ms":[2104.743],"encode_ms":[815.993],"decode_ms":[1955.424]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0002","text":"Let him come in, then, said the king, and as if Colbert had been listening at the door for the purpose of keeping himself accurant with the conversation, he entered as soon as the king had pronounced his name to the two courtiers.","audio_seconds":13.19,"processing_seconds":5.052,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[75],"mel_ms":[2097.65],"encode_ms":[810.048],"decode_ms":[2123.297]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0002","text":"There, Messiers Johnson and Hammer put into practice many of the ideas now standard in the art, and secured much useful data for the work in New York, of which the story has just been told.","audio_seconds":13.115,"processing_seconds":4.786,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[2094.086],"encode_ms":[813.383],"decode_ms":[1861.537]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0034","text":"All rose to do her reverence, as if something from heaven had miraculously appeared before them. But gazing on her, entranced with admiration, not one of them was able to address a single word to her.","audio_seconds":13.055,"processing_seconds":4.909,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[67],"mel_ms":[2111.73],"encode_ms":[806.242],"decode_ms":[1971.341]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0012","text":"For in the times before the Great Flood, Athens was the greatest and best of cities and did the noblest deeds and had the best constitution of any under the face of heaven.","audio_seconds":13.015,"processing_seconds":4.838,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[54],"mel_ms":[2101.29],"encode_ms":[811.335],"decode_ms":[1908.474]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0006","text":"In one place, at the head of the room, was a raised platform for the royal family, with elegant throne chairs for the king and queen, and six smaller but richly upholstered chairs for the snow-nosed princesses.","audio_seconds":12.955,"processing_seconds":5.045,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[73],"mel_ms":[2115.635],"encode_ms":[811.462],"decode_ms":[2099.907]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13754-0013","text":"Before this travesty on the administration of law could be brought before the court of last resort, and there met with the reversal and rebuke it deserved, men were imprisoned under sentence of many years duration.","audio_seconds":12.87,"processing_seconds":4.947,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[65],"mel_ms":[2107.14],"encode_ms":[802.322],"decode_ms":[2020.307]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-134647-0004","text":"Some of the penal regulations were copied from the Edicts of Diocletian, and this method of conversion was applauded by the same bishops who had felt the hand of oppression and pleaded for the rights of humanity.","audio_seconds":12.835,"processing_seconds":4.904,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[67],"mel_ms":[2131.267],"encode_ms":[799.997],"decode_ms":[1957.066]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134493-0003","text":"From the graveyard gate, one can count a dozen gaily painted farmhouses. The gilded weather vanes on the big red barns wink at each other across the green and brown and yellow fields.","audio_seconds":12.765,"processing_seconds":4.986,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[66],"mel_ms":[2098.107],"encode_ms":[842.988],"decode_ms":[2025.676]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0039","text":"The Christmas holidays came, and she and Anne returned to the parsonage and to that happy home circle in which alone their natures expanded. Amongst all other people, they shriveled up more or less.","audio_seconds":12.72,"processing_seconds":4.919,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[64],"mel_ms":[2112.471],"encode_ms":[802.83],"decode_ms":[1986.018]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274381-0015","text":"Though the discipline of the former parliamentary army was not contemptible, a more exact plan was introduced and rigorously executed by these new commanders.","audio_seconds":12.655,"processing_seconds":4.913,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[52],"mel_ms":[2099.528],"encode_ms":[808.444],"decode_ms":[1986.902]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0003","text":"My first and principal reason was that they enforced beyond all resistance on any student who might attempt to copy them this method of laying portions of distinct hue side by side.","audio_seconds":12.61,"processing_seconds":4.815,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[2102.323],"encode_ms":[812.452],"decode_ms":[1883.411]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79730-0009","text":"It is indeed true that the importance of tact and skill in the training of the young and of cultivating their reason and securing their affection cannot be overrated.","audio_seconds":12.585,"processing_seconds":4.717,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[2091.803],"encode_ms":[808.623],"decode_ms":[1799.11]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0007","text":"Two years before her death, I saw her perform the character of Marianne in the comedy of Marevaux, and in spite of her age and declining health, the illusion was complete.","audio_seconds":12.49,"processing_seconds":3.173,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[59],"mel_ms":[1140.684],"encode_ms":[642.882],"decode_ms":[1377.924]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79730-0007","text":"If you should not be a good girl, but should show signs of making us any trouble, I shall have to send you out somewhere to the back part of the house until we are gone.","audio_seconds":12.455,"processing_seconds":2.658,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[1088.901],"encode_ms":[458.003],"decode_ms":[1102.683]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0010","text":"There was watercress soup and sole, and a delightful omelette stuffed with mushrooms and truffles, and two small rare ducklings, and artichokes, and a dry yellow roan wine, of which Bartley had always been very fond.","audio_seconds":12.44,"processing_seconds":4.464,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[78],"mel_ms":[1105.359],"encode_ms":[922.139],"decode_ms":[2420.369]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-76324-0015","text":"Smuggling the house cleaning paraphernalia into the cellar window unobserved that afternoon proved no easy task, for Cynthia had added a whisk broom and dustpan to the outfit.","audio_seconds":12.405,"processing_seconds":5.198,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[66],"mel_ms":[2203.097],"encode_ms":[852.939],"decode_ms":[2121.56]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0017","text":"His legs, the best shaped at court, were displayed to great advantage in flesh-colored silken hose, of silk so fine and so transparent that it seemed almost like flesh itself.","audio_seconds":12.33,"processing_seconds":5.008,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[65],"mel_ms":[2181.6],"encode_ms":[825.582],"decode_ms":[1983.329]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0019","text":"for at the peril of her own existence, and when the other Hellenes had deserted her, she repelled the invader, and of her own accord gave liberty to all the nations within the Pillars.","audio_seconds":12.255,"processing_seconds":4.723,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[1982.095],"encode_ms":[796.892],"decode_ms":[1925.302]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13751-0009","text":"The first well-established seat of the church was in the pretty little town of Kirtland, Ohio, almost within sight of Lake Erie. And here soon rose the first temple of modern times.","audio_seconds":12.15,"processing_seconds":4.456,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[60],"mel_ms":[1878.037],"encode_ms":[767.214],"decode_ms":[1795.962]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5694-0000","text":"But already at a point in economic evolution far antedating the emergence of the lady, specialized consumption of goods as an evidence of pecuniary strength had begun to work out in a more or less elaborate system.","audio_seconds":12.085,"processing_seconds":4.5,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[70],"mel_ms":[1863.286],"encode_ms":[736.127],"decode_ms":[1884.175]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79740-0010","text":"Delia came to the parlor and with an air of great mystery beckoned the children aside and said to them in a whisper Leave Andella and Rosalie here, and don't say a word to them.","audio_seconds":12.025,"processing_seconds":4.214,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[60],"mel_ms":[1735.808],"encode_ms":[682.52],"decode_ms":[1781.087]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13751-0012","text":"The Lieutenant Governor Littleburn W. Boggs, afterward governor, was a pronounced Mormon hater, and throughout the period of the Troubles, he manifests his sympathy with the persecutors.","audio_seconds":12.015,"processing_seconds":4.191,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[1727.182],"encode_ms":[692.225],"decode_ms":[1756.724]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0013","text":"Lifting the iron hammer that hung at the portal, Hester Prynn gave a summons, which was answered by one of the governor's bondservants, a free-born Englishman, but now a seven year slave.","audio_seconds":11.985,"processing_seconds":4.095,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[70],"mel_ms":[1678.331],"encode_ms":[661.566],"decode_ms":[1740.458]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0001","text":"To the young American, here or elsewhere, the paths to fortune are innumerable and all open. There is invitation in the air and success in all his wide horizon.","audio_seconds":11.92,"processing_seconds":3.556,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[55],"mel_ms":[1527.383],"encode_ms":[595.4],"decode_ms":[1419.714]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-960-0009","text":"The dialogue is primarily concerned with the animal creation, including under this term the heavenly bodies, and with man only as one among the animals.","audio_seconds":11.86,"processing_seconds":3.465,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1494.54],"encode_ms":[596.541],"decode_ms":[1362.574]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41806-0008","text":"Olive has another lovely gift for the Yellow House, said Mother Carrie, rising. And to carry out the next part of the program, we shall have to go in procession upstairs to my bedroom.","audio_seconds":11.82,"processing_seconds":3.601,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[62],"mel_ms":[1479.114],"encode_ms":[588.81],"decode_ms":[1522.423]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0040","text":"In this incident, contrasting the creative and the destructive spirit of the factions, the Immigrant Aid Society of Massachusetts finds its most honorable and triumphant vindication.","audio_seconds":11.76,"processing_seconds":3.528,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[62],"mel_ms":[1465.04],"encode_ms":[590.729],"decode_ms":[1458.862]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0032","text":"The standard Edison meter practice was to remove the cells once a month to the meter room of the Central Station Company for examination, another set being substituted.","audio_seconds":11.69,"processing_seconds":3.533,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[1479.649],"encode_ms":[591.433],"decode_ms":[1449.864]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0012","text":"Her eyes seemed to regard him with mild pity. Her holiness, a strange light glowing faintly upon her frail flesh, did not humiliate the sinner who approached her.","audio_seconds":11.64,"processing_seconds":3.558,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[57],"mel_ms":[1479.192],"encode_ms":[597.202],"decode_ms":[1468.754]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0028","text":"I can set to work now to remember things I never remembered before, such as what I had to eat for breakfast this morning, and it can hardly be holy habit that enables me to do this.","audio_seconds":11.56,"processing_seconds":3.562,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[59],"mel_ms":[1487.887],"encode_ms":[600],"decode_ms":[1461.86]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0038","text":"And meantime, I know the greatness of Jehovah. I acknowledge the perfection of his word. I adore the purity of the Christian faith. My theory is right, my practice horribly wrong.","audio_seconds":11.535,"processing_seconds":3.818,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[63],"mel_ms":[1470.397],"encode_ms":[610.615],"decode_ms":[1723.641]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0004","text":"Listen then, Socrates, to a tale of Solens, who, being the friend of Dropidas, my great grandfather, told it to my grandfather Critias, and he told me.","audio_seconds":11.48,"processing_seconds":3.599,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[1485.487],"encode_ms":[590],"decode_ms":[1509.389]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0001","text":"Margolot had first made the girl's form from the patchwork quilt, and then she had dressed it with a patchwork skirt and an apron with pockets in it, using the same gay material throughout.","audio_seconds":11.43,"processing_seconds":3.644,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[66],"mel_ms":[1479.005],"encode_ms":[601.202],"decode_ms":[1550.537]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5696-0000","text":"Under the simple test of effectiveness for advertising, we should expect to find leisure and the conspicuous consumption of goods dividing the field of pecuniary emulation pretty evenly between them at the outset.","audio_seconds":11.415,"processing_seconds":3.654,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[69],"mel_ms":[1486.066],"encode_ms":[607.958],"decode_ms":[1546.22]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28233-0005","text":"Sometimes he would wander on foot upon the sandy shore, and sometimes he would enjoy a ride along the summit of the cliff, altogether being in no hurry at all to bring his task to an end.","audio_seconds":11.39,"processing_seconds":3.591,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[64],"mel_ms":[1478.089],"encode_ms":[592.299],"decode_ms":[1507.711]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0001","text":"He made a bow so deep that his back came near breaking. And he was dumbfounded, I can tell you, when he saw it was nobody but Anders.","audio_seconds":11.33,"processing_seconds":3.443,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[48],"mel_ms":[1474.578],"encode_ms":[594.572],"decode_ms":[1360.957]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0045","text":"Then the Republic of Briton Eula was to be declared as non-existent, and the British flag was to be exalted, and a British governor installed in the executive chambers.","audio_seconds":11.285,"processing_seconds":3.584,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[57],"mel_ms":[1481.953],"encode_ms":[590.99],"decode_ms":[1498.913]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5694-0014","text":"Many of these affiliated gentlemen of leisure are at the same time lesser men of substance in their own right, so that some of them are scarcely at all, others only partially, to be rated as vicarious consumers.","audio_seconds":11.255,"processing_seconds":3.638,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[67],"mel_ms":[1478.094],"encode_ms":[589.588],"decode_ms":[1558.142]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32879-0004","text":"But poor Rachel Lake had more than that stoical hypocrisy which enables the tortured spirits of her sex to lift a pale face through the flames and smile.","audio_seconds":11.21,"processing_seconds":3.679,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1508.383],"encode_ms":[651.555],"decode_ms":[1506.922]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0018","text":"Little Pearl, who was as greatly pleased with the gleaming armor as she had been with the glittering frontispiece of the house, spent some time looking into the polished mirror of the breastplate.","audio_seconds":11.16,"processing_seconds":3.592,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[62],"mel_ms":[1488.517],"encode_ms":[595.892],"decode_ms":[1495.796]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79740-0000","text":"To such persons, these indirect modes of training children in habits of subordination to their will, or rather, of yielding to their influence, are specially useful.","audio_seconds":11.125,"processing_seconds":3.526,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[52],"mel_ms":[1472.881],"encode_ms":[597.016],"decode_ms":[1443.546]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0023","text":"I think he was perhaps more appreciative that I was of the discipline of the Edison Construction Department, and thought it would be well for us to wait until the morning of the fourth before we started up.","audio_seconds":11.06,"processing_seconds":3.645,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[64],"mel_ms":[1485.125],"encode_ms":[599.99],"decode_ms":[1547.043]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0015","text":"This person was Rudolfo, who, though he had gone to look for his friends, had changed his mind in that respect, not thinking it advisable to acquaint them with what had passed between him and the girl.","audio_seconds":11.02,"processing_seconds":3.637,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[63],"mel_ms":[1504.93],"encode_ms":[590.905],"decode_ms":[1528.625]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0020","text":"The incident was not violent, nor even dramatic, no posse was summoned, no further effort made, and Reader, fearing personal violence, soon fled in disguise.","audio_seconds":10.975,"processing_seconds":3.751,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[1492.551],"encode_ms":[674.719],"decode_ms":[1570.716]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134493-0005","text":"He was a splendid figure of a boy, tall and straight as a young pine tree, with a handsome head and stormy grey eyes deeply set under a serious brow.","audio_seconds":10.945,"processing_seconds":3.933,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[1642.587],"encode_ms":[658.803],"decode_ms":[1616.471]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0023","text":"Let me say here distinctly to have done with it that this narrative, from an exact transcript of my own made much later, is what I shall presently give.","audio_seconds":10.91,"processing_seconds":3.659,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[49],"mel_ms":[1649.585],"encode_ms":[603.415],"decode_ms":[1393.361]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41806-0017","text":"We shut our eyes, the flowers bloom on, we murmur, but the corn ears fill. We choose the shadow, but the sun that cast it shines behind us still.","audio_seconds":10.895,"processing_seconds":3.589,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[53],"mel_ms":[1495.675],"encode_ms":[596.718],"decode_ms":[1484.863]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0015","text":"That summer the rains had been so many and opportune that it was almost more than Shabata and his man could do to keep up with the corn. The orchard was a neglected wilderness.","audio_seconds":10.815,"processing_seconds":3.859,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[54],"mel_ms":[1577.485],"encode_ms":[662.573],"decode_ms":[1607.019]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0031","text":"She was young, untried, nervous. It was a vision of serious duties and little company, of really great loneliness.","audio_seconds":10.765,"processing_seconds":3.461,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1527.977],"encode_ms":[593.758],"decode_ms":[1327.322]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0002","text":"He has no traditions to bind him or guide him, and his impulse is to break away from the occupation his father has followed, and make a new way for himself.","audio_seconds":10.73,"processing_seconds":3.483,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[1485.18],"encode_ms":[602.435],"decode_ms":[1383.558]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0017","text":"At one end stood a great fireplace in which a blue log was blazing with a blue flame, and over the fire hung four kettles in a row, all bubbling and steaming at a great rate.","audio_seconds":10.68,"processing_seconds":3.643,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[65],"mel_ms":[1476.453],"encode_ms":[602.395],"decode_ms":[1551.185]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0031","text":"Sometimes I don't want to do anything at all, and sometimes I want to pull the four corners of the divide together. He threw out his arm and brought it back with a jerk, so, like a tablecloth.","audio_seconds":10.61,"processing_seconds":3.784,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[68],"mel_ms":[1460.315],"encode_ms":[590.388],"decode_ms":[1721.369]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-960-0013","text":"It is probable that the relation of the ideas to God or of God to the world was differently conceived by him at different times of his life.","audio_seconds":10.575,"processing_seconds":3.759,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1644.991],"encode_ms":[651.503],"decode_ms":[1452.057]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13751-0008","text":"It is notable that the Indian tribes have generally regarded the religion of the Latter-day Saints with favor, seeing in the Book of Mormon striking agreement with their own traditions.","audio_seconds":10.555,"processing_seconds":3.994,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[1679.308],"encode_ms":[658.038],"decode_ms":[1644.411]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0014","text":"Among the country population, its place is to some extent taken by savings and home comforts known through the medium of neighborhood gossip sufficiently to serve the like general purpose of pecuniary repute.","audio_seconds":10.54,"processing_seconds":4.212,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[73],"mel_ms":[1648.871],"encode_ms":[666.923],"decode_ms":[1881.945]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0008","text":"All the morning they trudged up the mountain path, and at noon Unk and Ojo sat on a fallen tree trunk and ate the last of the bread which the old Munchkin had placed in his pocket.","audio_seconds":10.49,"processing_seconds":3.9,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[60],"mel_ms":[1649.021],"encode_ms":[651.388],"decode_ms":[1586.439]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0000","text":"He hoped there would be stew for dinner, turnips and carrots and bruised potatoes and fat mutton pieces to be ladled out in thick, peppered, flour-fattened sauce.","audio_seconds":10.435,"processing_seconds":3.872,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[57],"mel_ms":[1552.377],"encode_ms":[660.124],"decode_ms":[1646.95]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0042","text":"It is black in misfortune. It is blacker still in crime. These two blacknesses amalgamated composed slang.","audio_seconds":10.375,"processing_seconds":3.74,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1639.234],"encode_ms":[659.381],"decode_ms":[1429.569]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0020","text":"It was specially suited for a trial plant also. In the early days, when a yield of six or eight lamps to the horsepower was considered subject for congratulation.","audio_seconds":10.35,"processing_seconds":3.723,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[57],"mel_ms":[1647.491],"encode_ms":[633.251],"decode_ms":[1429.72]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0019","text":"Before any could stop him, he butted his majesty so furiously that the king soared far into the air and tumbled in a heap among the benches, where he lay moaning and groaning.","audio_seconds":10.28,"processing_seconds":3.679,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[59],"mel_ms":[1628.873],"encode_ms":[582.433],"decode_ms":[1456.157]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0004","text":"In winter, when the snow lay glittering on the ground, a hare would often come leaping along and jump right over the little tree.","audio_seconds":10.25,"processing_seconds":3.271,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1362.299],"encode_ms":[541.878],"decode_ms":[1355.138]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122612-0010","text":"See, said Uncas, pointing north and south, at the evident marks of the broad trail on either side of him, the dark hair has gone toward the forest.","audio_seconds":10.195,"processing_seconds":4.431,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1862.082],"encode_ms":[736.074],"decode_ms":[1820.162]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0006","text":"The pleasant graveyard of my soul with sentimental cypress trees and flowers is filled, that I may stroll in meditation at my ease.","audio_seconds":10.18,"processing_seconds":4.259,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1863.44],"encode_ms":[727.227],"decode_ms":[1655.259]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0005","text":"But her greeting to Captain Leake was more than usually haughty and frozen, and her features, I fancied, particularly proud and pale.","audio_seconds":10.12,"processing_seconds":4.335,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[48],"mel_ms":[1861.045],"encode_ms":[745.123],"decode_ms":[1715.035]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0054","text":"That Christ is very God is apparent in that Paul ascribes to him divine powers equally with the Father, as for instance the power to dispense grace and peace.","audio_seconds":10.085,"processing_seconds":3.952,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1814.555],"encode_ms":[558.52],"decode_ms":[1568.2]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0039","text":"In fact, the sound of Madame's and the Queen's carriages could be heard in the distance upon the hard, dry ground of the roads, followed by the mountain cavaliers.","audio_seconds":10.07,"processing_seconds":3.379,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[61],"mel_ms":[1383.379],"encode_ms":[542.653],"decode_ms":[1444.306]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0038","text":"Therefore, I feel myself quite able as President of this Republic to receive you with a courtesy due to the servants of a friendly ally.","audio_seconds":10.03,"processing_seconds":4.7,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1897.085],"encode_ms":[823.141],"decode_ms":[1968.609]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-31957-0008","text":"Nay, I rather thrilled, distrusting every light that seemed to gild the onward path, and feared to overlean, a finger even.","audio_seconds":10.005,"processing_seconds":4.94,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[2107.49],"encode_ms":[856.578],"decode_ms":[1961.595]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2300-131720-0030","text":"The principle employed in the Edison electrolytic meter is that which exemplifies the power of electricity to decompose a chemical substance.","audio_seconds":9.98,"processing_seconds":4.92,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[2171.13],"encode_ms":[809.856],"decode_ms":[1923.571]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-960-0020","text":"And hence, we find the same sort of clumsiness in the Timaeus of Plato, which characterizes the philosophical poem of Lucretius.","audio_seconds":9.88,"processing_seconds":4.841,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[2103.606],"encode_ms":[810.711],"decode_ms":[1912.221]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284449-0012","text":"I'll gladly do that, promised the new Boolaroo. And I'll feed the honorable goat all the shavings and leather and tin cans he can eat, besides the grass.","audio_seconds":9.87,"processing_seconds":4.927,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[2093.833],"encode_ms":[815.42],"decode_ms":[2003.257]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0020","text":"Thus did the humane and right-minded father comfort his unhappy daughter, and her mother embracing her again did all she could to soothe the feelings.","audio_seconds":9.82,"processing_seconds":4.822,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[2111.867],"encode_ms":[811.06],"decode_ms":[1883.692]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0020","text":"Till we arise linked in a golden band and never part, but walk, united bearing food to all our tender flowers.","audio_seconds":9.8,"processing_seconds":4.707,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[2111.452],"encode_ms":[818.93],"decode_ms":[1764.9]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0011","text":"The lodge in which Uncas was confined was in the very center of the village, and in a situation perhaps more difficult than any other to approach or leave without observation.","audio_seconds":9.76,"processing_seconds":4.8,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[53],"mel_ms":[1986.789],"encode_ms":[768.168],"decode_ms":[2030.963]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0044","text":"After this disappointment, I never dare reckon with certainty on the enjoyment of a pleasure again. It seems as if some fatality stood between you and me.","audio_seconds":9.72,"processing_seconds":4.605,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[54],"mel_ms":[1966.246],"encode_ms":[767.217],"decode_ms":[1856.802]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0027","text":"Disdainful of a success of which Madame showed no acknowledgment, he thought of nothing but boldly regaining the marked preference of the princess.","audio_seconds":9.675,"processing_seconds":4.545,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[1961.736],"encode_ms":[764.087],"decode_ms":[1805.844]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0031","text":"And there you are. You will, of course, appreciate that the unfinished sentences not only save time, but also make the maneuvering very much more natural.","audio_seconds":9.64,"processing_seconds":4.471,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[1962.92],"encode_ms":[757.827],"decode_ms":[1737.115]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0004","text":"I heard father tell cousin Abner that he was whipped so often for whistling when he was a boy that he was determined to have what compensation he could get now.","audio_seconds":9.61,"processing_seconds":4.415,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1874.991],"encode_ms":[733.43],"decode_ms":[1792.592]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0005","text":"While the old gold and the marble stays, forever gleaming is soft, strong blaze, calm in the early evening glow.","audio_seconds":9.575,"processing_seconds":4.301,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1862.542],"encode_ms":[735.227],"decode_ms":[1688.396]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0055","text":"Sir, I have it in command to inform your excellency that you have been appointed governor of the Crown Colony, which is called Briton Eula.","audio_seconds":9.555,"processing_seconds":4.508,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1899.275],"encode_ms":[732.941],"decode_ms":[1862.928]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0025","text":"She rose with a fleeting glance, gathered the shawl around her, then, gliding forward, wavering tremulous, slipped across the road and into the swamp.","audio_seconds":9.5050625,"processing_seconds":4.488,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[58],"mel_ms":[1876.071],"encode_ms":[725.1],"decode_ms":[1871.747]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0016","text":"On the contrary, he resolved to tell them that repenting of his violence and moved by a tears, he had only carried her halfway towards his house and then let her go.","audio_seconds":9.49,"processing_seconds":4.495,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[53],"mel_ms":[1862.759],"encode_ms":[735.598],"decode_ms":[1883.498]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3979-0011","text":"The Lord who has given us power to teach and to hear, let him also give us the power to serve and to do. Luke two.","audio_seconds":9.45,"processing_seconds":4.424,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1951.006],"encode_ms":[762.629],"decode_ms":[1697.313]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0003","text":"I wanted nothing more than to see my country again, my friends, my modest quarters by the botanical gardens, my dearly beloved collections.","audio_seconds":9.34,"processing_seconds":4.382,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1874.518],"encode_ms":[732.041],"decode_ms":[1761.729]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284449-0007","text":"Now then, let's enter the city and enjoy the great feast that's being cooked. I'm nearly starved myself, for this conquering kingdoms is hard work.","audio_seconds":9.31,"processing_seconds":4.48,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[56],"mel_ms":[1864.88],"encode_ms":[731.063],"decode_ms":[1871.455]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0025","text":"I see they lay helpless and naked, weeping, and none to answer, none to cherish thee with mother's smiles.","audio_seconds":9.265,"processing_seconds":3.963,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1727.379],"encode_ms":[690.909],"decode_ms":[1533.167]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0042","text":"Relocated footnote. Governor Robinson being on his way east, the steamboat on which he was traveling stopped at Lexington, Missouri.","audio_seconds":9.225,"processing_seconds":4.149,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[49],"mel_ms":[1770.481],"encode_ms":[688.108],"decode_ms":[1678.536]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0016","text":"Yes, and something better, something still grand will surely follow. Or wherefore should they thus ornament me?","audio_seconds":9.215,"processing_seconds":3.925,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1756.977],"encode_ms":[687.969],"decode_ms":[1468.362]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0025","text":"Again, I thank you. This incident, I suppose, will be renewed no more. If I live to be an old woman, I shall remember it thirty years hence as a bright dream.","audio_seconds":9.205,"processing_seconds":4.205,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[60],"mel_ms":[1743.09],"encode_ms":[689.402],"decode_ms":[1760.585]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0024","text":"He could hardly stand still, so great was his mental agitation, and he ran towards Holmes with two eager hands outstretched. Thank heaven that you have come!","audio_seconds":9.185,"processing_seconds":4.221,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[1751.195],"encode_ms":[725.375],"decode_ms":[1732.001]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0018","text":"There was something in his carriage which resembled the buoyant movements of an immortal, and he did not dance so much as seemed to soar along.","audio_seconds":9.14,"processing_seconds":4.008,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1738.28],"encode_ms":[682.365],"decode_ms":[1575.614]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0023","text":"I carefully avoid any appearance of preoccupation and eccentricity, which might lead those I live amongst to suspect the nature of my pursuits.","audio_seconds":9.095,"processing_seconds":4.05,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[49],"mel_ms":[1727.073],"encode_ms":[686.289],"decode_ms":[1625.268]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1836-0014","text":"Fortunately, said Mr. Vanderpool, Northerners and Southerners are arriving at a better mutual understanding on most of these matters.","audio_seconds":9.045,"processing_seconds":4.071,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[1730.201],"encode_ms":[689.368],"decode_ms":[1639.792]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0004","text":"Of course, he did not realize that it was I who was knocking, but nonetheless his conduct was very uncourteous, and indeed, under the circumstances, rather suspicious.","audio_seconds":9.005,"processing_seconds":4.244,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[61],"mel_ms":[1733.592],"encode_ms":[694.297],"decode_ms":[1803.609]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0007","text":"She pushed him toward the big chair by the fire and sat down on a stool at the opposite side of the hearth, her knees drawn up to her chin, laughing like a happy little girl.","audio_seconds":8.975,"processing_seconds":4.321,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[62],"mel_ms":[1755.671],"encode_ms":[725.344],"decode_ms":[1826.268]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0029","text":"Beth was a beautiful girl, the handsomest of the three cousins by far, yet Eliza surpassed her in natural charm, and seemed well aware of the fact.","audio_seconds":8.945,"processing_seconds":4.173,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[55],"mel_ms":[1725.711],"encode_ms":[688.185],"decode_ms":[1746.535]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0000","text":"I will endeavor in my statement to avoid such terms as would serve to limit the events to any particular place or give a clue as to the people concerned.","audio_seconds":8.94,"processing_seconds":4.094,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1751.968],"encode_ms":[688.673],"decode_ms":[1641.455]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32879-0000","text":"It was not very much past eleven that morning when the pony carriage from Brandon drew up before the little garden wicket of Redmond's Farm.","audio_seconds":8.92,"processing_seconds":4.163,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1786.135],"encode_ms":[728.056],"decode_ms":[1635.558]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0020","text":"The scout, who had left David at the door to ascertain they were not observed, thought it prudent to preserve his disguise until assured of their privacy.","audio_seconds":8.895,"processing_seconds":4.157,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1732.582],"encode_ms":[690.858],"decode_ms":[1721.078]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0017","text":"Stephen, leaning back and drawing idly on his scribbler, listened to the talk about him, which Heron checked from time to time by saying.","audio_seconds":8.87,"processing_seconds":4.021,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1746.031],"encode_ms":[689.133],"decode_ms":[1574.683]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0024","text":"One day, when the boy was sent by his grandfather with a message to a relation, he passed along a street in which there was a great concourse of horsemen.","audio_seconds":8.845,"processing_seconds":4.115,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[53],"mel_ms":[1735.582],"encode_ms":[690.18],"decode_ms":[1677.651]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0000","text":"The analysis of knowledge will occupy us until the end of the 13th lecture and is the most difficult part of our whole enterprise.","audio_seconds":8.805,"processing_seconds":4.016,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1760.928],"encode_ms":[684.472],"decode_ms":[1558.868]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0007","text":"Hester Prynne, nevertheless, the loving mother of this one child, ran little risk of erring on the side of undue severity.","audio_seconds":8.795,"processing_seconds":3.999,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1728.775],"encode_ms":[685.564],"decode_ms":[1573.931]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0013","text":"So for the hundredth time she was thinking today as she walked alone up the lane back of the barn and then slowly down through the bottoms.","audio_seconds":8.77,"processing_seconds":4.062,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1738.311],"encode_ms":[688.766],"decode_ms":[1622.869]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0038","text":"Ruth was glad to hear that Philip had made a push into the world, and she was sure that his talent and courage would make a way for him.","audio_seconds":8.74,"processing_seconds":3.943,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1728.581],"encode_ms":[682.66],"decode_ms":[1520.074]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0012","text":"But Philip did afford it, and he wrote, thanking his friends and declining because he said the political scheme would fail and ought to fail.","audio_seconds":8.71,"processing_seconds":4.076,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1729.014],"encode_ms":[689.136],"decode_ms":[1645.403]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-126133-0007","text":"But Polly couldn't speak, and if Jasper hadn't caught her just in time, she would have tumbled over backward from the stool, Franzi and all.","audio_seconds":8.68,"processing_seconds":4.091,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[48],"mel_ms":[1755.707],"encode_ms":[684.694],"decode_ms":[1639.085]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284449-0001","text":"Then they all marched out a little way into the fields and found that the army of Pinkies had already formed and was advancing steadily toward them.","audio_seconds":8.63,"processing_seconds":4.044,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[1721.31],"encode_ms":[687.957],"decode_ms":[1622.937]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0029","text":"It is sold everywhere, but for the last three weeks, nobody will use any snuff, but that sold at the Savet Cat.","audio_seconds":8.605,"processing_seconds":3.981,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1738.686],"encode_ms":[688.608],"decode_ms":[1541.832]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0005","text":"It is the head of a parrot with a little flower in his beak from a picture of Carpathios, one of his series of the life of St. George.","audio_seconds":8.56,"processing_seconds":4.047,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1728.121],"encode_ms":[689.672],"decode_ms":[1617.701]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28241-0008","text":"The Earth has undoubtedly entered upon a new orbit, but she is not incurring any probable risk of being precipitated onto the sun.","audio_seconds":8.54,"processing_seconds":4.093,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1732.789],"encode_ms":[688.787],"decode_ms":[1659.207]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-31957-0023","text":"I love thee freely as men strive for right. I love thee purely as they turn from praise.","audio_seconds":8.515,"processing_seconds":3.843,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1746.379],"encode_ms":[680.922],"decode_ms":[1406.94]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0027","text":"If you dressed in silk and gold from top to toe, you could not look any nicer than in your little red cap.","audio_seconds":8.5,"processing_seconds":3.865,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1725.77],"encode_ms":[681.082],"decode_ms":[1446.308]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0018","text":"For a moment, Beth stood staring while the new maid regarded her with composure and a slight smile upon her beautiful face.","audio_seconds":8.445,"processing_seconds":3.97,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1731.56],"encode_ms":[690.925],"decode_ms":[1536.329]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0015","text":"Will cried he softly, and Stutley, who had chosen his couch across the door of his young master's chamber, sprang up at once in answer.","audio_seconds":8.415,"processing_seconds":4.275,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1733.574],"encode_ms":[684.32],"decode_ms":[1844.995]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-23283-0009","text":"Oh, my lord, cried Miss Woodley, with a most forcible accent, you are the last person on earth she would pardon me for entrusting.","audio_seconds":8.395,"processing_seconds":4.157,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1723.246],"encode_ms":[692.751],"decode_ms":[1728.901]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0010","text":"Never did he object to buckling up his suitcase for any country whatever, China or the Congo, no matter how far off it was.","audio_seconds":8.34,"processing_seconds":4.024,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1719.07],"encode_ms":[693.572],"decode_ms":[1600.041]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41806-0001","text":"Tonight there was no need of extra heat, and there were great ceremonies to be observed in lighting the fires on the hearthstones.","audio_seconds":8.31,"processing_seconds":4.051,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1730.704],"encode_ms":[688.744],"decode_ms":[1619.314]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0026","text":"But first I will tell you that for many years I have longed for a servant to help me with the housework and to cook the meals and wash the dishes.","audio_seconds":8.29,"processing_seconds":3.918,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1639.69],"encode_ms":[658.578],"decode_ms":[1608.619]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0012","text":"Now that's impossible, Rahdy, for I really don't think I once thought of him all this evening, except just while we were talking.","audio_seconds":8.26,"processing_seconds":3.934,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1659.885],"encode_ms":[650.277],"decode_ms":[1613.162]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0019","text":"Uncas occupied a distant corner in a reclining attitude, being rigidly bound both hands and feet by strong and painful widths.","audio_seconds":8.23,"processing_seconds":4.222,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1730.915],"encode_ms":[692.064],"decode_ms":[1787.207]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41797-0021","text":"She is wonderful, more wonderful than anybody we've ever seen anywhere, and she draws better than the teacher in Charlestown.","audio_seconds":8.23,"processing_seconds":4.042,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1737.256],"encode_ms":[696.673],"decode_ms":[1595.383]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0010","text":"She screamed and shouted too with a terrific volume of sound, which doubtless caused the hearts of the fugitives to quake within them.","audio_seconds":8.2,"processing_seconds":4.128,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[1733.063],"encode_ms":[696.423],"decode_ms":[1686.659]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0023","text":"Goobs don't grow on the tops of vines, but underground, on the roots, like yams. Is that so?","audio_seconds":8.14,"processing_seconds":4.019,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1732.552],"encode_ms":[691.96],"decode_ms":[1583.204]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0019","text":"Then there were three or four leading men of the community with their wives, who were for the most part the fathers and mothers of the young ladies.","audio_seconds":8.105,"processing_seconds":4.012,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1740.365],"encode_ms":[688.042],"decode_ms":[1572.698]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0027","text":"To say nothing, said Montalay, so that when Mademoiselle de Tonetchirant thinks, Athenay is the only one who knows it.","audio_seconds":8.09,"processing_seconds":4.093,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1700.543],"encode_ms":[689.714],"decode_ms":[1692.437]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0023","text":"He well knew the perils of the frontier, the savage state of society, the lurking Indians, and the dangers of fever.","audio_seconds":8.07,"processing_seconds":4.07,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1727.807],"encode_ms":[685.667],"decode_ms":[1646.265]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0001","text":"But the windows are patched with wooden panes, and the door, I think, is like the gate. It is never opened.","audio_seconds":8.03,"processing_seconds":3.881,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1736.676],"encode_ms":[690.818],"decode_ms":[1441.075]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0013","text":"And he went back to his books and to his waiting for an opening large enough for his dignified entrance into the literary world.","audio_seconds":8.01,"processing_seconds":3.901,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1712.425],"encode_ms":[687.606],"decode_ms":[1490.102]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0041","text":"No harm would have been done had it not been that as he passed your door, he perceived the key which had been left by the carelessness of your servant.","audio_seconds":7.99,"processing_seconds":4.073,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1701.882],"encode_ms":[687.389],"decode_ms":[1672.995]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1836-0003","text":"She was not herself a notably intelligent woman. She greatly admired intelligence or whatever looked to her like intelligence in others.","audio_seconds":7.965,"processing_seconds":4.038,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1704.446],"encode_ms":[694.624],"decode_ms":[1627.263]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0014","text":"I come now to the other characteristic which memory images must have in order to account for our knowledge of the past.","audio_seconds":7.94,"processing_seconds":3.903,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1694.937],"encode_ms":[689.077],"decode_ms":[1507.984]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0038","text":"Achison, who had been haranguing the mob, planted his two guns before the building and trained them upon it.","audio_seconds":7.92,"processing_seconds":4.085,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1722.537],"encode_ms":[691.316],"decode_ms":[1658.826]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-287645-0003","text":"Of this party, Edward, a boy of seventeen, called forth much sympathy. He too was claimed by Holland.","audio_seconds":7.905,"processing_seconds":3.961,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1722.652],"encode_ms":[692.142],"decode_ms":[1535.605]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122612-0008","text":"The eyes of the whole party followed the unexpected movement and read their success in the air of triumph that the youth assumed.","audio_seconds":7.875,"processing_seconds":3.974,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1707.318],"encode_ms":[684.344],"decode_ms":[1570.513]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0031","text":"They set up a crane over the fire and hung the pot upon it, and we sat and watched it boil while we joked. At last the supper began.","audio_seconds":7.845,"processing_seconds":3.89,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1648.682],"encode_ms":[658.103],"decode_ms":[1571.479]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0020","text":"If we had retained the subject or act in knowledge, the whole problem of memory would have been comparatively simple.","audio_seconds":7.835,"processing_seconds":3.927,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1669.78],"encode_ms":[686.074],"decode_ms":[1560.272]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0010","text":"But in Egypt, the traditions of our own and other lands are by us registered forever in our temples.","audio_seconds":7.83,"processing_seconds":3.798,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1674.227],"encode_ms":[687.535],"decode_ms":[1425.674]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0023","text":"Uncas, who had already approached the door in readiness to lead the way, now recoiled and placed himself once more in the bottom of the lodge.","audio_seconds":7.815,"processing_seconds":4.185,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[50],"mel_ms":[1728.684],"encode_ms":[689.139],"decode_ms":[1756.112]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0001","text":"This reality begins to explain the dark power and otherworldly fascination of 20,000 Leagues Under the Seas.","audio_seconds":7.805,"processing_seconds":4.012,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1724.154],"encode_ms":[693.658],"decode_ms":[1582.085]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0007","text":"He spoke French perfectly, I've been told, when need was, but delighted usually in talking the broadest Yorkshire.","audio_seconds":7.775,"processing_seconds":4.06,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1733.678],"encode_ms":[689.45],"decode_ms":[1624.302]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0001","text":"His hat had a peaked crown and a flat brim, and around the brim was a row of tiny golden bells that tinkled when he moved.","audio_seconds":7.755,"processing_seconds":4.246,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1747.508],"encode_ms":[725.423],"decode_ms":[1761.416]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134691-0023","text":"It was a pain to see them and a sword-like pain to see the signs of adolescence that made repellent their pitiable nakedness.","audio_seconds":7.735,"processing_seconds":4.335,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1875.15],"encode_ms":[735.369],"decode_ms":[1712.993]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1836-0006","text":"She was therefore most agreeably surprised to hear Mr. Cresswell express himself so cordially as approving of Negro education.","audio_seconds":7.715,"processing_seconds":4.361,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1860.684],"encode_ms":[732.664],"decode_ms":[1755.303]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0036","text":"He planted a company before the hotel and demanded a surrender of the arms belonging to the Free State Military Companies.","audio_seconds":7.705,"processing_seconds":4.258,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1889.261],"encode_ms":[737.214],"decode_ms":[1619.8]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0002","text":"Instead of shoes, the old man wore boots with turnover tops and his blue coat had wide cuffs of gold braid.","audio_seconds":7.68,"processing_seconds":4.308,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1886.507],"encode_ms":[732.165],"decode_ms":[1677.267]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-960-0007","text":"But they have nothing to do with the interpretation of Plato, and in spirit, they are opposed to him.","audio_seconds":7.64,"processing_seconds":4.053,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1869.335],"encode_ms":[704.725],"decode_ms":[1467.902]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0003","text":"but here he was at a terrible disadvantage as compared with the owls, hawks, and eagles. He had no rending claws.","audio_seconds":7.6,"processing_seconds":4.052,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1729.769],"encode_ms":[692.413],"decode_ms":[1618.969]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0049","text":"It was simple enough, sir. If you only had known, but with all your cleverness, it was impossible that you could know.","audio_seconds":7.575,"processing_seconds":4.292,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1858.346],"encode_ms":[730.836],"decode_ms":[1689.927]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0024","text":"How much of evil, a real accomplished evil, had there not occurred to me during the last few days?","audio_seconds":7.56,"processing_seconds":4.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1875.995],"encode_ms":[696.028],"decode_ms":[1535.012]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0020","text":"Of course, he reflected, she always had that combination of something homely and sensible, and something utterly wild and daft.","audio_seconds":7.55,"processing_seconds":4.048,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1726.7],"encode_ms":[689.5],"decode_ms":[1619.932]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0035","text":"True history being a mixture of all things, the true historian mingles in everything.","audio_seconds":7.535,"processing_seconds":3.866,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1724.962],"encode_ms":[680.459],"decode_ms":[1450.619]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0015","text":"Suddenly, for the purpose of restoring peace and order, Spring, accompanied by his whole court, made his appearance.","audio_seconds":7.515,"processing_seconds":4.052,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1743.747],"encode_ms":[694.494],"decode_ms":[1602.963]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5696-0002","text":"Are the circumstances permitting that instinct disposes men to look with favor upon productive efficiency and on whatever is of human use?","audio_seconds":7.51,"processing_seconds":4.027,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1727.506],"encode_ms":[692.792],"decode_ms":[1594.808]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0014","text":"What is the tumult and rioting? cried out the squire authoritatively, and he blew twice on the silver whistle which hung at his belt.","audio_seconds":7.485,"processing_seconds":4.114,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[46],"mel_ms":[1724.342],"encode_ms":[690.368],"decode_ms":[1686.608]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0006","text":"Very much of squalor and discomfort will be endured before the last trinket or the last pretense of pecuniary decency is put away.","audio_seconds":7.47,"processing_seconds":4.199,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[45],"mel_ms":[1745.901],"encode_ms":[720.959],"decode_ms":[1720.999]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0025","text":"You know I've just been telling you how this school of materialism and clay involved itself at last in cloud and fire.","audio_seconds":7.45,"processing_seconds":4.002,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1735.608],"encode_ms":[682.028],"decode_ms":[1573.966]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0025","text":"They were upon the verge of an open trap in the far corner of the hut, and Stutley had tripped over the edge of the reversed flapmouth of this pit.","audio_seconds":7.435,"processing_seconds":4.139,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[49],"mel_ms":[1742.23],"encode_ms":[689.366],"decode_ms":[1695.795]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0013","text":"Jack had been standing in the far corner of the room talking to Eva and was now reduced to silence by his praises.","audio_seconds":7.41,"processing_seconds":3.919,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1734.211],"encode_ms":[682.332],"decode_ms":[1491.942]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0005","text":"He reckoned, therefore, not only upon ascertaining the extent of the late catastrophe, but upon learning its cause.","audio_seconds":7.4,"processing_seconds":4.012,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1735.67],"encode_ms":[694.197],"decode_ms":[1569.999]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123286-0003","text":"You seem anxious, my uncle, I said, seeing him continually with his glass to his eye. Anxious","audio_seconds":7.37,"processing_seconds":4.109,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1739.294],"encode_ms":[747.233],"decode_ms":[1611.613]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0004","text":"Whatever Lord Shelford said, Miss Brandon received it very graciously, and even with a momentary smile.","audio_seconds":7.365,"processing_seconds":4.25,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1876.845],"encode_ms":[732.58],"decode_ms":[1628.584]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0005","text":"She, a Tory and clergyman's daughter, was always in a minority of one in our house of violent descent and radicalism.","audio_seconds":7.34,"processing_seconds":4.393,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1865.869],"encode_ms":[735.044],"decode_ms":[1779.978]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0006","text":"From rubbing shoulders with scientists in our little universe by the Botanical Gardens, the boy had come to know a thing or two.","audio_seconds":7.32,"processing_seconds":4.338,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[43],"mel_ms":[1860.958],"encode_ms":[731.837],"decode_ms":[1732.972]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0016","text":"Hilda watched him from the corner, trembling and scarcely breathing, dark shadows growing about her eyes.","audio_seconds":7.3,"processing_seconds":4.326,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1864.16],"encode_ms":[735.372],"decode_ms":[1715.163]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5696-0008","text":"But it is on other grounds worth noting that the term waste in the language of everyday life implies deprecation of what is characterized as wasteful.","audio_seconds":7.26,"processing_seconds":4.487,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[49],"mel_ms":[1860.59],"encode_ms":[733.495],"decode_ms":[1882.237]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0024","text":"They moved thereafter cautiously about the hut, groping before and about them to find something to show that the Warranton had fulfilled his mission.","audio_seconds":7.235,"processing_seconds":4.493,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[52],"mel_ms":[1876.449],"encode_ms":[740.974],"decode_ms":[1862.778]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0013","text":"He was a fanatic on formality, and he only addressed me in the third person, to the point where it got tiresome.","audio_seconds":7.2,"processing_seconds":4.36,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1863.106],"encode_ms":[734.024],"decode_ms":[1750.093]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0037","text":"The Delaware dog, he said, leaning forward and peering through the dim light to catch the expression of the other's features. Is he afraid?","audio_seconds":7.18,"processing_seconds":4.459,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[47],"mel_ms":[1864],"encode_ms":[735.815],"decode_ms":[1847.083]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0044","text":"I was to be taken away and carried to England, or elsewhere, or drowned upon the voyage, it mattered not which.","audio_seconds":7.17,"processing_seconds":4.36,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1871.599],"encode_ms":[735.927],"decode_ms":[1739.365]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0023","text":"I couldn't shiver much being bound so tight, but when I'm loose, I mean to have just one good shiver to relieve my feelings, and I'm not sure.","audio_seconds":7.155,"processing_seconds":4.342,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[51],"mel_ms":[1867.961],"encode_ms":[728.992],"decode_ms":[1733.317]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0061","text":"Not gold or silver or pastual lambs or an angel, but himself. What for?","audio_seconds":7.12,"processing_seconds":4.169,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1850.602],"encode_ms":[732.866],"decode_ms":[1575.367]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0013","text":"Do you know? Lake? Oh, I really can't tell, but he'll soon tire of country life.","audio_seconds":7.095,"processing_seconds":4.272,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1864.839],"encode_ms":[727.747],"decode_ms":[1669.005]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0014","text":"Yea, his honorable worship is within, but he hath a godly minister or two with him, and likewise a leech.","audio_seconds":7.07,"processing_seconds":4.112,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1735.319],"encode_ms":[693.179],"decode_ms":[1672.675]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0033","text":"What I mean is that I want you to promise never to see me again, no matter how often I come, no matter how hard I beg.","audio_seconds":7.06,"processing_seconds":4.31,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1861.106],"encode_ms":[732.053],"decode_ms":[1706.285]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0005","text":"Like the dove's voice, like transient day, like music in the air. Ah,","audio_seconds":7.035,"processing_seconds":4.227,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1865.953],"encode_ms":[734.989],"decode_ms":[1614.373]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28241-0009","text":"And what demonstration do you offer? asked Servadac eagerly, that it will not happen.","audio_seconds":7.01,"processing_seconds":4.307,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1878.352],"encode_ms":[734],"decode_ms":[1682.948]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0007","text":"It is such a noble ambition that it is a pity it has usually such a shallow foundation.","audio_seconds":6.995,"processing_seconds":4.097,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1862.24],"encode_ms":[727.635],"decode_ms":[1496.614]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0036","text":"The wharves of Brooklyn and every part of New York bordering the East River were crowded with curiosity seekers.","audio_seconds":6.985,"processing_seconds":4.198,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1760.411],"encode_ms":[737.835],"decode_ms":[1688.691]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0053","text":"Were I to comply with your orders without expressing my own opinion, I should seem to have done so willingly hereafter.","audio_seconds":6.955,"processing_seconds":4.214,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1867.673],"encode_ms":[730.71],"decode_ms":[1604.688]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0040","text":"Indeed, there were only one or two strangers who could be admitted among the sisters without producing the same result.","audio_seconds":6.905,"processing_seconds":4.093,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1775.617],"encode_ms":[731.38],"decode_ms":[1576.046]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0037","text":"But that wise and placid woman understood the sweet rebel a great deal better than Ruth understood herself.","audio_seconds":6.885,"processing_seconds":4.116,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1789.477],"encode_ms":[737.736],"decode_ms":[1578.708]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0008","text":"The question is which of the two methods will most effectively reach the persons whose convictions it is desired to affect?","audio_seconds":6.845,"processing_seconds":4.195,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1786.948],"encode_ms":[735.571],"decode_ms":[1663.263]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134493-0004","text":"The air and the earth are curiously mated and intermingled as if the one were the breath of the other.","audio_seconds":6.825,"processing_seconds":4.204,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1874.79],"encode_ms":[733.063],"decode_ms":[1587.222]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-126133-0013","text":"I know, gasped Polly, controlling her sobs. I won't, only I can't thank you.","audio_seconds":6.815,"processing_seconds":4.101,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1866.758],"encode_ms":[717.334],"decode_ms":[1506.853]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0008","text":"I cannot allow the examination to be held if one of the papers has been tampered with. The situation must be faced.","audio_seconds":6.795,"processing_seconds":4.123,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1830.355],"encode_ms":[727.762],"decode_ms":[1554.609]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0033","text":"As he had promised to protect the hotel, the reassured citizens began to laugh at their own fears.","audio_seconds":6.775,"processing_seconds":4.168,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1842.169],"encode_ms":[727.2],"decode_ms":[1587.229]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0031","text":"He continued his pretended search and to give colour to his errand, made two arrest.","audio_seconds":6.75,"processing_seconds":4.088,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1862.628],"encode_ms":[702.712],"decode_ms":[1512.248]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0009","text":"January and February of 1837 had passed away, and still there was no reply from the Southe.","audio_seconds":6.73,"processing_seconds":4.034,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1761.53],"encode_ms":[691.374],"decode_ms":[1569.183]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-121726-0007","text":"Horse sense. A degree of wisdom that keeps one from betting on the races.","audio_seconds":6.73,"processing_seconds":3.937,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1730.412],"encode_ms":[690.358],"decode_ms":[1506.492]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-126133-0011","text":"Isn't he splendid? cried Jasper, in intense pride, swelling up. Father knew how to do it.","audio_seconds":6.71,"processing_seconds":4.089,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1716.59],"encode_ms":[697.665],"decode_ms":[1663.782]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-287645-0013","text":"As to his age and also the name of his master, Jacob's statement varied somewhat from the advertisement.","audio_seconds":6.665,"processing_seconds":4.229,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1870.423],"encode_ms":[727.767],"decode_ms":[1620.29]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123440-0019","text":"cried Alice again, for this time the mouse was bristling all over, and she felt certain it must be really offended.","audio_seconds":6.63,"processing_seconds":4.005,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1720.489],"encode_ms":[683.052],"decode_ms":[1591.125]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0033","text":"Every plant in the grass is set formally, grows perfectly, and may be realized completely.","audio_seconds":6.625,"processing_seconds":3.93,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1746.023],"encode_ms":[691.735],"decode_ms":[1484.045]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0025","text":"A gentle kick from the tall boy in the bench behind urged Stephen to ask a difficult question.","audio_seconds":6.61,"processing_seconds":4.054,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1727.032],"encode_ms":[703.409],"decode_ms":[1612.678]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-23283-0019","text":"I will make no unjust use of what I know, he replied with firmness. I believe you, my lord.","audio_seconds":6.585,"processing_seconds":3.906,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1721.022],"encode_ms":[692.871],"decode_ms":[1481.455]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0057","text":"Yes, in reality, those were happy times.","audio_seconds":6.56,"processing_seconds":3.978,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1729.481],"encode_ms":[703.34],"decode_ms":[1537.755]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0032","text":"However, her features and form might repress any evidence of nervousness. These hands told a different story.","audio_seconds":6.555,"processing_seconds":4.256,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1850.343],"encode_ms":[741.206],"decode_ms":[1653.809]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0003","text":"Without his scrapbooks, his chemicals, and his homely untidiness, he was an uncomfortable man.","audio_seconds":6.55,"processing_seconds":4.322,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1870.498],"encode_ms":[751.577],"decode_ms":[1689.805]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0052","text":"I must come another day and see your husband. I want to have a consultation with him about horses.","audio_seconds":6.53,"processing_seconds":4.224,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1863.88],"encode_ms":[729.037],"decode_ms":[1620.497]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0045","text":"I'm not good enough for you, and you must be kept from the contamination of too intimate society.","audio_seconds":6.52,"processing_seconds":4.195,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1856.444],"encode_ms":[729.817],"decode_ms":[1598.442]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0048","text":"Give me a check for 150, and I'll turn over to you the forged check and quash further proceedings.","audio_seconds":6.495,"processing_seconds":4.119,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1724.317],"encode_ms":[691.244],"decode_ms":[1693.002]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0031","text":"We want to know, Mr. Gilchrist, how you, an honorable man, ever came to commit such an action as that of yesterday.","audio_seconds":6.47,"processing_seconds":4.045,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1724.997],"encode_ms":[684.102],"decode_ms":[1625.426]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0005","text":"Do you suppose that God, for the sake of a few Lutheran heretics, would disown his entire church?","audio_seconds":6.45,"processing_seconds":4.168,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1817.329],"encode_ms":[732.518],"decode_ms":[1607.537]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0051","text":"When you argue about the nature of God, apart from the question of justification, you may be as profound as you like.","audio_seconds":6.44,"processing_seconds":3.962,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1724.916],"encode_ms":[687.441],"decode_ms":[1538.814]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0037","text":"So much for the title of the epistle. Now follows the greeting of the apostle. Verse 3.","audio_seconds":6.42,"processing_seconds":4.08,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1731.852],"encode_ms":[688.588],"decode_ms":[1649.397]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0048","text":"said Captain Donythorne, seating himself where he could see along the short passage to the open dairy door.","audio_seconds":6.39,"processing_seconds":4.376,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1866.222],"encode_ms":[731.035],"decode_ms":[1767.384]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0011","text":"He gave way to the others very readily and retreated unperceived by the squire and mistress Fitzooth to the rear of the tent.","audio_seconds":6.375,"processing_seconds":4.44,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1862.596],"encode_ms":[732.59],"decode_ms":[1832.885]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0025","text":"So, Uncas, you had better take the lead, while I will put on the skin again and trust to cunning for want of speed.","audio_seconds":6.36,"processing_seconds":4.436,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1865.918],"encode_ms":[739.02],"decode_ms":[1820.852]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0001","text":"He had preconceived ideas about everything, and his idea about Americans was that they should be engineers or mechanics.","audio_seconds":6.35,"processing_seconds":4.37,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1847.408],"encode_ms":[734.793],"decode_ms":[1777.226]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0024","text":"The first of our vague but indubitable data is that there is knowledge of the past.","audio_seconds":6.34,"processing_seconds":4.258,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1871.162],"encode_ms":[737.012],"decode_ms":[1639.258]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123288-0027","text":"A suffocating smell of nitrogen fills the air, it enters the throat, it fills the lungs.","audio_seconds":6.305,"processing_seconds":4.252,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1874.787],"encode_ms":[733.36],"decode_ms":[1632.556]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28241-0016","text":"You must see, Lieutenant, I should think, that we are not so near the coast of Algeria as you imagined.","audio_seconds":6.285,"processing_seconds":4.095,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1743.912],"encode_ms":[731.546],"decode_ms":[1609.327]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0052","text":"The real human division is this the luminous and the shady.","audio_seconds":6.275,"processing_seconds":3.826,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1730.793],"encode_ms":[692.391],"decode_ms":[1392.725]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0015","text":"There cannot be a doubt he received you kindly, for in fact, you returned without his permission.","audio_seconds":6.26,"processing_seconds":3.982,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1725.077],"encode_ms":[691.327],"decode_ms":[1554.941]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0019","text":"My yacht is at your service, sir, even should you require to make a tour around the world.","audio_seconds":6.2400625,"processing_seconds":4.009,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1733.569],"encode_ms":[685.738],"decode_ms":[1579.522]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8224-274384-0007","text":"Have mercy, Lord, on me, I pray, for men would me devour.","audio_seconds":6.23,"processing_seconds":3.984,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1745.467],"encode_ms":[736.728],"decode_ms":[1492.379]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0018","text":"I sit down at a small table. A waiter comes immediately to inquire my wishes.","audio_seconds":6.21,"processing_seconds":4.267,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1871.622],"encode_ms":[760.141],"decode_ms":[1625.198]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0022","text":"There is the slang of the affected lady as well as of the press users.","audio_seconds":6.2,"processing_seconds":4.301,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1909.563],"encode_ms":[774.099],"decode_ms":[1606.437]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36377-0007","text":"A little cracked. That, in the popular phrase, was my impression of the stranger who now made his appearance in the supper room.","audio_seconds":6.18,"processing_seconds":4.523,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[42],"mel_ms":[1943.485],"encode_ms":[766.592],"decode_ms":[1801.679]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-75918-0017","text":"But in this friendly pressure, Rao could detect the nervous agitation of a great internal conflict.","audio_seconds":6.16,"processing_seconds":4.237,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1868.051],"encode_ms":[726.448],"decode_ms":[1632.412]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-76324-0004","text":"But Joyce had not been listening. All at once she put down her candle on the table and faced her companion.","audio_seconds":6.15,"processing_seconds":4.27,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1860.189],"encode_ms":[734.681],"decode_ms":[1661.876]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0002","text":"My friend's temper had not improved since he had been deprived of the congenial surroundings of Baker Street.","audio_seconds":6.135,"processing_seconds":4.308,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1875.808],"encode_ms":[727.487],"decode_ms":[1695.022]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0020","text":"This is the explanation of the shallows which are found in that part of the Atlantic Ocean.","audio_seconds":6.125,"processing_seconds":4.18,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1859.069],"encode_ms":[737.182],"decode_ms":[1573.423]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0014","text":"Now, when has horror ever excluded studying the channel?","audio_seconds":6.115,"processing_seconds":4.114,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1875.657],"encode_ms":[729.834],"decode_ms":[1499.422]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0042","text":"So no tales got out to the neighbors. Besides, it was a lonely place, and by good luck, no one came that way.","audio_seconds":6.095,"processing_seconds":4.335,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1900.408],"encode_ms":[734.866],"decode_ms":[1687.787]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0000","text":"Young Fitzuth had been commanded to his mother's chamber so soon as he had come out from his converse with the squire.","audio_seconds":6.075,"processing_seconds":4.109,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[41],"mel_ms":[1749.329],"encode_ms":[689.563],"decode_ms":[1660.021]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0029","text":"Your letter has given me great pleasure, and I should not forgive myself if I did not tell you so.","audio_seconds":6.055,"processing_seconds":3.951,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1723.392],"encode_ms":[688.501],"decode_ms":[1527.957]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0012","text":"She looked at his heavy shoulders and big, determined head, thrust forward like a catapult in leash.","audio_seconds":6.025,"processing_seconds":4.174,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1741.026],"encode_ms":[731.182],"decode_ms":[1691.467]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41806-0013","text":"Approaching the dining table, he carefully placed the article in the center and removed the cloth.","audio_seconds":6.02,"processing_seconds":4.075,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1725.357],"encode_ms":[685.584],"decode_ms":[1653.912]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0040","text":"He returned carrying his jumping shoes, which are provided, as you are aware, with several sharp spikes.","audio_seconds":5.985,"processing_seconds":4.069,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[38],"mel_ms":[1737.79],"encode_ms":[691.068],"decode_ms":[1630.273]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0012","text":"The Nautilus nearly perishes in the Antarctic and Nemo sinks into a growing depression.","audio_seconds":5.9650625,"processing_seconds":4.054,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1747.132],"encode_ms":[732.351],"decode_ms":[1564.904]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0018","text":"This, she said, was true hospitality. And I am not sure that I did not agree with that.","audio_seconds":5.925,"processing_seconds":4.049,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1755.458],"encode_ms":[728.441],"decode_ms":[1555.981]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0020","text":"Yes, we are, certainly, I replied evasively. But after we make a detour, I'm sorry.","audio_seconds":5.915,"processing_seconds":4.04,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1750.547],"encode_ms":[688.741],"decode_ms":[1591.164]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0016","text":"The glimmering sea of delicate leaves whispered and murmured before her, stretching away to the northward.","audio_seconds":5.9,"processing_seconds":4.128,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1750.435],"encode_ms":[727.33],"decode_ms":[1640.614]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0013","text":"You'll easily judge why when you hear. Because the thing had been such a scare? He continued to fix me.","audio_seconds":5.895,"processing_seconds":4.214,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1763.276],"encode_ms":[732.462],"decode_ms":[1705.944]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0052","text":"Here is a ring for Sift the Friendly, and here is a bracelet, and a sword would not be ashamed to hang at your side.","audio_seconds":5.88,"processing_seconds":4.37,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1882.637],"encode_ms":[728.358],"decode_ms":[1748.317]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0022","text":"They were both remembering what the woman had said when she took the money. God give you a happy love.","audio_seconds":5.865,"processing_seconds":4.28,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1873.044],"encode_ms":[742.338],"decode_ms":[1654.298]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-75918-0006","text":"This has indeed been a harassing day, continued the young man, his eyes fixed upon his friend.","audio_seconds":5.85,"processing_seconds":4.151,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1859.088],"encode_ms":[729.339],"decode_ms":[1552.373]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0022","text":"In the evenings I confess, I do think, but I never trouble anyone else with my thoughts.","audio_seconds":5.825,"processing_seconds":3.89,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1718.217],"encode_ms":[684.291],"decode_ms":[1478.576]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0034","text":"The rector paused and then, shaking his clasped hands before him, went on.","audio_seconds":5.81,"processing_seconds":4.014,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1762.645],"encode_ms":[689.12],"decode_ms":[1553.469]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36377-0023","text":"You were quite right to say no, Ambrose began. Never smoke with John Iago. His cigars will poison you.","audio_seconds":5.79,"processing_seconds":4.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1751.19],"encode_ms":[688.54],"decode_ms":[1670.542]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36377-0024","text":"Naomi shook her forefinger reproachfully at them, as if the two sturdy young farmers had been two children.","audio_seconds":5.78,"processing_seconds":4.052,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1738.723],"encode_ms":[690.161],"decode_ms":[1612.947]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0010","text":"Old dances are simplified of their yearning, bleached by time.","audio_seconds":5.77,"processing_seconds":3.966,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1810.495],"encode_ms":[730.345],"decode_ms":[1416.64]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0037","text":"What could he do? He caught up everything which would betray him, and he rushed into your bedroom to conceal himself.","audio_seconds":5.73,"processing_seconds":4.063,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[39],"mel_ms":[1726.958],"encode_ms":[682.362],"decode_ms":[1642.633]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0014","text":"Here, go and get me change for Louis. I have it, sir.","audio_seconds":5.71,"processing_seconds":3.906,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1761.484],"encode_ms":[689.339],"decode_ms":[1446.776]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0027","text":"As soon as these dispositions were made, the scout turned to David and gave him his parting instructions.","audio_seconds":5.6899375,"processing_seconds":4.109,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1801.338],"encode_ms":[732.318],"decode_ms":[1565.584]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0054","text":"Oh, sir, said Mrs. Poiser, rather alarmed, you wouldn't like it at all.","audio_seconds":5.68,"processing_seconds":4.002,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1728.279],"encode_ms":[689.728],"decode_ms":[1574.922]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0017","text":"Some mysterious force seemed to have brought about a convulsion of the elements.","audio_seconds":5.665,"processing_seconds":3.91,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1725.662],"encode_ms":[689.084],"decode_ms":[1486.108]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134691-0022","text":"He stood still in deference to their calls and parried their banter with easy words.","audio_seconds":5.635,"processing_seconds":4.05,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1741.35],"encode_ms":[685.152],"decode_ms":[1613.883]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41797-0002","text":"Grandfather was Alexander Carey L L D, Doctor of Laws, that is.","audio_seconds":5.625,"processing_seconds":3.918,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1725.692],"encode_ms":[689.858],"decode_ms":[1493.37]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0023","text":"You see, I've lived all my life with Unc Nunky, the silent one, and there was no one to tell me anything.","audio_seconds":5.61,"processing_seconds":4.147,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[37],"mel_ms":[1782.558],"encode_ms":[729.327],"decode_ms":[1625.333]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0039","text":"I can assure you, he has not even allowed me to see the trigger since I have been on board.","audio_seconds":5.59,"processing_seconds":3.933,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1717.173],"encode_ms":[694.12],"decode_ms":[1511.939]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0025","text":"Exquisite soft turf of the woods, the happiness which your friendship confers upon me.","audio_seconds":5.57,"processing_seconds":4.073,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1726.902],"encode_ms":[689.072],"decode_ms":[1648.032]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0069","text":"The vicious character of sin is brought out by the words, Who gave Himself for our sins.","audio_seconds":5.5550625,"processing_seconds":3.995,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1731.854],"encode_ms":[684.608],"decode_ms":[1567.201]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0056","text":"The peculiar circumstances of the colony are within your excellency's knowledge.","audio_seconds":5.545,"processing_seconds":4.006,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1750.619],"encode_ms":[697.171],"decode_ms":[1549.317]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0059","text":"But it is surmised that you will find difficulties in the way of your entering at once upon your governor.","audio_seconds":5.535,"processing_seconds":3.911,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1730.483],"encode_ms":[689.984],"decode_ms":[1480.918]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0011","text":"Paul declares that the false apostles were called or sent neither by men nor by man.","audio_seconds":5.525,"processing_seconds":3.913,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1666.49],"encode_ms":[690.399],"decode_ms":[1547.049]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28233-0006","text":"No cathedral, not even Burgos itself, could vie with the church at Montmartre.","audio_seconds":5.505,"processing_seconds":3.939,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1750.852],"encode_ms":[691.249],"decode_ms":[1489.01]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0026","text":"She closed her eyes and took a deep breath as if to draw in again the fragrance of those days.","audio_seconds":5.495,"processing_seconds":4.008,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1728.604],"encode_ms":[684.747],"decode_ms":[1584.469]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0004","text":"As soon as they entered the room of the great knife, the Bularu gave a yell of disappointment.","audio_seconds":5.485,"processing_seconds":4.063,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1728.117],"encode_ms":[689.3],"decode_ms":[1635.186]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0005","text":"But suppose you said, I'm fond of writing. My people always say my letters home are good enough for punch.","audio_seconds":5.47,"processing_seconds":4.013,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1718.818],"encode_ms":[687.902],"decode_ms":[1594.87]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0000","text":"Fast as his legs could carry him, Servadac had made his way to the top of the cliff.","audio_seconds":5.455,"processing_seconds":3.988,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1732.725],"encode_ms":[693.899],"decode_ms":[1553.059]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0033","text":"She rose quickly to her feet with an impetuous gesture that made her visitor catch her breath.","audio_seconds":5.45,"processing_seconds":3.987,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1744.805],"encode_ms":[688.736],"decode_ms":[1545.147]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0004","text":"I should never have asked you if Molly had been here, for I remember you don't like English cookery.","audio_seconds":5.435,"processing_seconds":4.176,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1732.501],"encode_ms":[722.494],"decode_ms":[1711.551]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0020","text":"where the waves for an instant sank, they came closer, but not quite within grasping reach.","audio_seconds":5.415,"processing_seconds":4.424,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1868.016],"encode_ms":[731.63],"decode_ms":[1812.327]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0028","text":"Nonsense. Of course I can't really sing, except the way my mother and grandmother did before me.","audio_seconds":5.405,"processing_seconds":4.277,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[36],"mel_ms":[1862.44],"encode_ms":[725.051],"decode_ms":[1679.024]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0024","text":"For a while she lay in her chair in happy, dreamy pleasure at sun and bird and tree.","audio_seconds":5.385,"processing_seconds":4.218,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1865.24],"encode_ms":[730.998],"decode_ms":[1611.616]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0021","text":"He still held onto it with both hands as he rushed into his mother's cottage.","audio_seconds":5.365,"processing_seconds":4.044,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1816.955],"encode_ms":[725.283],"decode_ms":[1492.076]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0028","text":"The head in chief of the riot, the Nottingham Apprentice, with clenched fists, threatened Montfichet.","audio_seconds":5.355,"processing_seconds":4.253,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[40],"mel_ms":[1812.529],"encode_ms":[725.357],"decode_ms":[1703.832]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0024","text":"I stood with my back to the wall, for I wanted no sword reaching out of the dark for me.","audio_seconds":5.345,"processing_seconds":4.167,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1837.457],"encode_ms":[723.155],"decode_ms":[1597.219]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0029","text":"Sometimes it is called a crazy quilt because the patches and colors are so mixed up.","audio_seconds":5.335,"processing_seconds":4.22,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1856.903],"encode_ms":[723.034],"decode_ms":[1630.592]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0027","text":"They they excite me in some way, and I I can't bear them. You must excuse me.","audio_seconds":5.32,"processing_seconds":4.102,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1851.28],"encode_ms":[702.121],"decode_ms":[1538.108]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0014","text":"The leaders of the conspiracy became distrustful of their power to crush the town.","audio_seconds":5.295,"processing_seconds":4.031,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1857.518],"encode_ms":[698.629],"decode_ms":[1467.487]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0029","text":"Our baggage was immediately carried to the deck of the frigate. I rushed aboard.","audio_seconds":5.285,"processing_seconds":3.964,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[32],"mel_ms":[1724.364],"encode_ms":[694.116],"decode_ms":[1536.084]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0024","text":"That is one reason you are Ojo the unlucky, said the woman in a sympathetic tone.","audio_seconds":5.26,"processing_seconds":4.089,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1723.448],"encode_ms":[720.324],"decode_ms":[1636.54]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79759-0002","text":"They are chiefly formed from combinations of the impressions made in childhood.","audio_seconds":5.25,"processing_seconds":4.152,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1866.217],"encode_ms":[723.765],"decode_ms":[1552.759]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0009","text":"She ran to her husband's side at once and helped him lift the four kettles from the fire.","audio_seconds":5.245,"processing_seconds":4.136,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1858.149],"encode_ms":[696.776],"decode_ms":[1571.717]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123288-0017","text":"Is the atmospheric conditioning having once reached its density to become final?","audio_seconds":5.225,"processing_seconds":3.94,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1745.839],"encode_ms":[697.692],"decode_ms":[1488.131]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0004","text":"Number ten, fresh Nelly is waiting on you. Good night, husband.","audio_seconds":5.2150625,"processing_seconds":4.225,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1861.409],"encode_ms":[730.756],"decode_ms":[1623.211]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0036","text":"Eliza closed the door behind her with a decided slam, and a key clicked in the lock.","audio_seconds":5.2,"processing_seconds":4.168,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1723.177],"encode_ms":[733.061],"decode_ms":[1702.04]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0005","text":"This was a formable array of advantages. Slavery was playing with loaded dice.","audio_seconds":5.18,"processing_seconds":4.216,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1871.537],"encode_ms":[727.722],"decode_ms":[1607.012]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0012","text":"Through the black night rain, he sang to her window bars.","audio_seconds":5.17,"processing_seconds":4.035,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1748.06],"encode_ms":[736.16],"decode_ms":[1541.976]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0024","text":"Algebra, medicine, botany have each their slang.","audio_seconds":5.14,"processing_seconds":4.191,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1749.615],"encode_ms":[730.338],"decode_ms":[1702.012]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122617-0015","text":"But the bear, instead of obeying, maintained the seat it had taken and growled.","audio_seconds":5.125,"processing_seconds":4.176,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1859.042],"encode_ms":[728.044],"decode_ms":[1579.306]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0002","text":"But don't these very wise things sometimes turn out very foolishly?","audio_seconds":5.125,"processing_seconds":4.023,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1793.94],"encode_ms":[734.286],"decode_ms":[1484.561]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0015","text":"Most people talk too much, so it is a relief to find one who talks too little.","audio_seconds":5.115,"processing_seconds":4.07,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1760.469],"encode_ms":[729.543],"decode_ms":[1571.032]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0016","text":"I pass away, yet I complain, and no one hears my voice.","audio_seconds":5.105,"processing_seconds":4.118,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1856.481],"encode_ms":[732.445],"decode_ms":[1520.091]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284449-0020","text":"The combined bands of both the countries played the music and a fine suburb was served.","audio_seconds":5.095,"processing_seconds":4.18,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1874.389],"encode_ms":[723.578],"decode_ms":[1571.932]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0027","text":"Robin carefully descended the ladder and found himself soon upon firm rocky ground.","audio_seconds":5.08,"processing_seconds":3.932,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1729.784],"encode_ms":[688.152],"decode_ms":[1505.049]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0002","text":"A brisk wind had come up and was driving puffy white clouds across the sky.","audio_seconds":5.07,"processing_seconds":4.061,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1767.18],"encode_ms":[736.723],"decode_ms":[1547.72]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36586-0003","text":"But this subject will be more properly discussed when we treat of the different races of mankind.","audio_seconds":5.055,"processing_seconds":3.903,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1716.222],"encode_ms":[687.274],"decode_ms":[1490.883]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0012","text":"The hawk alighted on the dead branch and sat upright, motionless, as if surprised.","audio_seconds":5.045,"processing_seconds":4.008,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1718.107],"encode_ms":[685.604],"decode_ms":[1594.816]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-75918-0002","text":"Congratulations were poured in upon the princess everywhere during her journey.","audio_seconds":5.025,"processing_seconds":3.996,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1764.399],"encode_ms":[727.84],"decode_ms":[1494.436]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0009","text":"Each will therefore serve about equally well during the earlier stages of social growth.","audio_seconds":5.025,"processing_seconds":3.898,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1657.617],"encode_ms":[694.205],"decode_ms":[1537.857]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0005","text":"Seeing that I am so fine, I may as well go and visit the king.","audio_seconds":5.015,"processing_seconds":3.931,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1828.429],"encode_ms":[693.463],"decode_ms":[1400.734]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0068","text":"The greatness of the ransom, Christ the Son of God, indicates this.","audio_seconds":5,"processing_seconds":4.099,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1738.995],"encode_ms":[728.949],"decode_ms":[1620.89]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0032","text":"For a moment, Gilchrist, with upraised hand, tried to control his writhing features.","audio_seconds":4.995,"processing_seconds":4.227,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1865.629],"encode_ms":[731.157],"decode_ms":[1620.154]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13754-0004","text":"Already a north and a south were talked of. Why not set up also a west?","audio_seconds":4.985,"processing_seconds":4.458,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1920.879],"encode_ms":[756.841],"decode_ms":[1770.681]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0007","text":"At the prow I carved the head with open mouth and forked tongue thrust out.","audio_seconds":4.975,"processing_seconds":4.393,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1943.434],"encode_ms":[765.304],"decode_ms":[1674.522]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0017","text":"The cloud then showed his golden head and his bright form emerged.","audio_seconds":4.95,"processing_seconds":4.318,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1973.428],"encode_ms":[756.534],"decode_ms":[1579.027]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0052","text":"You will allow me to suggest, said he, that that is a matter of opinion.","audio_seconds":4.94,"processing_seconds":4.285,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1953.793],"encode_ms":[746.727],"decode_ms":[1575.134]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0026","text":"The strollers took their part in it with hearty zest now that they had some chance of beating off their foes.","audio_seconds":4.92,"processing_seconds":4.308,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1865.696],"encode_ms":[728.144],"decode_ms":[1704.205]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0012","text":"Please forgive me for this underhanded way of admitting that I had turned forty.","audio_seconds":4.905,"processing_seconds":4.265,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1877.517],"encode_ms":[730.793],"decode_ms":[1647.383]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0003","text":"She has a son, theft, and a daughter, hunger.","audio_seconds":4.895,"processing_seconds":4.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1865.957],"encode_ms":[731.072],"decode_ms":[1513.715]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-81414-0023","text":"Perchance too, Caffer's death might serve him in good stead.","audio_seconds":4.885,"processing_seconds":4.293,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1875.374],"encode_ms":[726.584],"decode_ms":[1681.543]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0015","text":"Conseil, I called a third time. Conseil appeared.","audio_seconds":4.88,"processing_seconds":4.402,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1906.461],"encode_ms":[760.989],"decode_ms":[1726.004]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123440-0011","text":"No, I've made up my mind about it. If I'm Mabel, I'll stay down here.","audio_seconds":4.87,"processing_seconds":4.243,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1849.442],"encode_ms":[729.303],"decode_ms":[1655.273]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0050","text":"They snuffed about the fir tree and rustled among the branches.","audio_seconds":4.855,"processing_seconds":4.157,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1923.739],"encode_ms":[754.592],"decode_ms":[1470.076]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0008","text":"Paul takes pride in his ministry, not to his own praise, but to the praise of God.","audio_seconds":4.84,"processing_seconds":4.147,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1807.156],"encode_ms":[724.205],"decode_ms":[1606.685]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0012","text":"It wasn't simply that she said so, but that I knew she hadn't. I was sure I could see that.","audio_seconds":4.83,"processing_seconds":4.343,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[33],"mel_ms":[1886.058],"encode_ms":[727.724],"decode_ms":[1721.017]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0017","text":"Something better, something still grander must follow. But what","audio_seconds":4.82,"processing_seconds":4.174,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1867.97],"encode_ms":[728.975],"decode_ms":[1568.063]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0003","text":"Gentlemen, do your posts, whereupon Saint Aignon and Villeroy took their leave.","audio_seconds":4.81,"processing_seconds":3.997,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1724.244],"encode_ms":[687.398],"decode_ms":[1576.762]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-31957-0002","text":"I did not wrong myself so, but I placed a wrong on thee.","audio_seconds":4.79,"processing_seconds":3.913,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1733.783],"encode_ms":[690.606],"decode_ms":[1479.706]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0042","text":"You hear what Sir Ferdinando Brown has said, replied Captain Battleaxe.","audio_seconds":4.78,"processing_seconds":4.153,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1731.102],"encode_ms":[711.802],"decode_ms":[1701.235]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0047","text":"Master Monceau, the Sheriff of Nottingham, was mightily put about when told of the rioting.","audio_seconds":4.775,"processing_seconds":4.332,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1863.814],"encode_ms":[734.001],"decode_ms":[1724.466]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0014","text":"We ought to have more attendance, Beth, said Louise, approaching her cousin.","audio_seconds":4.77,"processing_seconds":4.216,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1880.653],"encode_ms":[727.441],"decode_ms":[1598.263]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0041","text":"You see, loving someone as I love you makes the whole world different.","audio_seconds":4.755,"processing_seconds":4.092,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1867.101],"encode_ms":[721.542],"decode_ms":[1494.139]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135766-0014","text":"Pearl saw and gazed intently, but never sought to make acquaintance.","audio_seconds":4.75,"processing_seconds":4.068,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1728.625],"encode_ms":[689.298],"decode_ms":[1641.288]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0022","text":"I suppose, though, it's too early for them. Then came the explosion.","audio_seconds":4.745,"processing_seconds":3.867,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1721.559],"encode_ms":[680.697],"decode_ms":[1455.912]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123286-0013","text":"The shadow of the raft was clearly outlined upon the surface of the waves.","audio_seconds":4.73,"processing_seconds":3.973,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1731.436],"encode_ms":[696.576],"decode_ms":[1536.551]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0012","text":"Never mind now, interposed the captain. We will talk of that by and by the way.","audio_seconds":4.73,"processing_seconds":4.115,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1716.486],"encode_ms":[697.119],"decode_ms":[1693.129]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0009","text":"Not at all. You are, on the contrary, most agreeable to me.","audio_seconds":4.72,"processing_seconds":4.065,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1738.391],"encode_ms":[698.576],"decode_ms":[1618.931]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0005","text":"Once fairly awing, however, he wheeled and made back hurriedly for his perch.","audio_seconds":4.7,"processing_seconds":3.962,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[31],"mel_ms":[1726.509],"encode_ms":[694.665],"decode_ms":[1532.38]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0011","text":"I'm running for representative on the Republican ticket, said Kenneth quietly.","audio_seconds":4.685,"processing_seconds":3.968,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1712.016],"encode_ms":[695.604],"decode_ms":[1552.058]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0029","text":"On Friday, confession will be heard all the afternoon after Beads.","audio_seconds":4.67,"processing_seconds":4.083,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1754.544],"encode_ms":[733.351],"decode_ms":[1586.472]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0051","text":"I am by no means old, said the fir tree.","audio_seconds":4.665,"processing_seconds":4.098,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1727.001],"encode_ms":[735.76],"decode_ms":[1624.113]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-76324-0012","text":"We'll come in here this afternoon with old clothes on and have a regular house cleaning.","audio_seconds":4.655,"processing_seconds":4.299,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1879.002],"encode_ms":[731.881],"decode_ms":[1678.49]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5695-0013","text":"Consumption becomes a larger element in the standard of living in the city than in the country.","audio_seconds":4.64,"processing_seconds":4.217,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1885.955],"encode_ms":[730.549],"decode_ms":[1590.706]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0007","text":"Servadac took it for granted that the Dobrina was endeavoring to put in.","audio_seconds":4.625,"processing_seconds":4.135,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1732.795],"encode_ms":[693.814],"decode_ms":[1699.502]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0000","text":"It was the Indian, whose dark silhouette appeared suddenly upon his blind.","audio_seconds":4.615,"processing_seconds":3.984,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1745.027],"encode_ms":[694.498],"decode_ms":[1535.922]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2961-961-0006","text":"And what was the subject of the poem? said the person who made the remark.","audio_seconds":4.6,"processing_seconds":4.023,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1780.758],"encode_ms":[734.77],"decode_ms":[1496.211]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0012","text":"Then I will get me a farm and will winter in that land. Now who will follow me?","audio_seconds":4.59,"processing_seconds":4.138,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1757.13],"encode_ms":[734.898],"decode_ms":[1637.454]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0010","text":"And in this last action he falls into the classic sin of pride.","audio_seconds":4.5800625,"processing_seconds":4.137,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1864.832],"encode_ms":[730.483],"decode_ms":[1532.917]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0007","text":"The moment I looked at my table, I was aware that someone had rummaged among my papers.","audio_seconds":4.565,"processing_seconds":4.258,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[30],"mel_ms":[1850.883],"encode_ms":[722.429],"decode_ms":[1674.726]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123286-0029","text":"Those huge creatures attacked each other with the greatest animosity.","audio_seconds":4.545,"processing_seconds":3.894,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1728.932],"encode_ms":[688.608],"decode_ms":[1467.724]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0038","text":"I will ask the least imaginable, but I must have something.","audio_seconds":4.53,"processing_seconds":3.978,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1772.728],"encode_ms":[731.002],"decode_ms":[1465.785]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0014","text":"Descend, O little cloud, and hover before the eyes of Fellow.","audio_seconds":4.52,"processing_seconds":4.138,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1767.878],"encode_ms":[736.288],"decode_ms":[1625.082]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0009","text":"Like us not, young master, though I am an old man.","audio_seconds":4.51,"processing_seconds":4.326,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1864.031],"encode_ms":[721.658],"decode_ms":[1731.425]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0004","text":"Certainly, sire, but I must have money to do that. What is it?","audio_seconds":4.49,"processing_seconds":4.289,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1868.352],"encode_ms":[721.729],"decode_ms":[1690.361]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0015","text":"The squares of cotton, sharp-edged, heavy, were just about to burst to bowls.","audio_seconds":4.485,"processing_seconds":4.114,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[34],"mel_ms":[1845.881],"encode_ms":[719.9],"decode_ms":[1541.016]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0016","text":"Milligram, roughly one twenty-eight thousandth of an ounce.","audio_seconds":4.475,"processing_seconds":4.21,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1850.722],"encode_ms":[710.224],"decode_ms":[1640.615]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0034","text":"The Duchess of Southbridge to Lord Reggie. Oh, Reggie, what did you say?","audio_seconds":4.465,"processing_seconds":4.006,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1718.203],"encode_ms":[691.318],"decode_ms":[1588.045]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0013","text":"Before them fled the stroller and his three sons, capless and terrified.","audio_seconds":4.45,"processing_seconds":4.214,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1849.021],"encode_ms":[729.966],"decode_ms":[1626.105]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0008","text":"Lend me your ear for ten minutes, and you shall learn just what stagecraft is.","audio_seconds":4.43,"processing_seconds":4.265,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1857.487],"encode_ms":[730.102],"decode_ms":[1667.88]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0024","text":"I like to talk to Carl about New York and what a fellow can do there.","audio_seconds":4.41,"processing_seconds":4.187,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1848.191],"encode_ms":[729.169],"decode_ms":[1601.158]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0013","text":"You know, I thought the dance a bit conscious tonight for the first time.","audio_seconds":4.4,"processing_seconds":4.144,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1852.811],"encode_ms":[722.762],"decode_ms":[1559.948]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0014","text":"Do not, therefore, think that the Gothic school is an easy one.","audio_seconds":4.39,"processing_seconds":4.334,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1847.611],"encode_ms":[735.497],"decode_ms":[1741.723]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0016","text":"We will go out together to the bower. There is a way down to the court from my window.","audio_seconds":4.37,"processing_seconds":4.271,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[29],"mel_ms":[1864.519],"encode_ms":[727.659],"decode_ms":[1669.487]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-41806-0009","text":"exclaimed Bill Haran to his wife as they went through the lighted hall.","audio_seconds":4.355,"processing_seconds":4.083,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1812.024],"encode_ms":[690.352],"decode_ms":[1571.616]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-287645-0010","text":"He worked me very hard. He wanted to be beating me all the time.","audio_seconds":4.325,"processing_seconds":3.873,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1723.616],"encode_ms":[689.995],"decode_ms":[1450.854]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0013","text":"And why it scatters its bright beauty through the humid air.","audio_seconds":4.315,"processing_seconds":4.038,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1775.972],"encode_ms":[730.959],"decode_ms":[1522.784]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123288-0004","text":"The air is heavy, the sea is calm.","audio_seconds":4.31,"processing_seconds":3.925,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1777.457],"encode_ms":[730.158],"decode_ms":[1409.343]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0006","text":"It might have seemed that a trout of this size was a fairly substantial meal.","audio_seconds":4.295,"processing_seconds":4.235,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1784.047],"encode_ms":[760.418],"decode_ms":[1682.426]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0004","text":"When they were outside, Ung simply latched the door and started up the path.","audio_seconds":4.285,"processing_seconds":4.235,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1867.416],"encode_ms":[731.362],"decode_ms":[1625.597]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1180-0011","text":"I am, my dear, and all strangers are welcome to my home.","audio_seconds":4.275,"processing_seconds":4.116,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1850.963],"encode_ms":[721.498],"decode_ms":[1536.078]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123286-0011","text":"Nothing new, weather unchanged. The wind freshens.","audio_seconds":4.255,"processing_seconds":4.171,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1859.001],"encode_ms":[727.209],"decode_ms":[1575.79]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1188-133604-0031","text":"There's one and there's another, the Dudley and the Flint.","audio_seconds":4.25,"processing_seconds":4.099,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1881.316],"encode_ms":[729.744],"decode_ms":[1477.105]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0034","text":"A Montfichet, a Monfiche, Game Well to the Rescue.","audio_seconds":4.23,"processing_seconds":4.298,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1808.84],"encode_ms":[730.338],"decode_ms":[1749.417]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0053","text":"He is my esquire, Excellency, returned Robin with dignity.","audio_seconds":4.22,"processing_seconds":4.274,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1860.882],"encode_ms":[731.895],"decode_ms":[1672.338]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0043","text":"I reside in the Marais Gru de Duzport.","audio_seconds":4.205,"processing_seconds":4.135,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1867.246],"encode_ms":[726.091],"decode_ms":[1532.88]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0021","text":"I thought it therefore my duty when I left school to become a governess.","audio_seconds":4.18,"processing_seconds":4.292,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1867.611],"encode_ms":[732.737],"decode_ms":[1682.87]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0016","text":"To all these inquiries, the Count responded in the affirmative.","audio_seconds":4.17,"processing_seconds":4.104,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1860.977],"encode_ms":[727.548],"decode_ms":[1507.613]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0008","text":"The arrow pierced his heart and wounded him mortally.","audio_seconds":4.155,"processing_seconds":4.075,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1856.046],"encode_ms":[722.134],"decode_ms":[1489.743]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0013","text":"He mentions the apostles first because they were appointed directly by God.","audio_seconds":4.145,"processing_seconds":3.927,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1747.668],"encode_ms":[691.145],"decode_ms":[1479.4]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0024","text":"The departure was not at all agreeable.","audio_seconds":4.13,"processing_seconds":3.926,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1740.836],"encode_ms":[726.425],"decode_ms":[1450.467]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0014","text":"Sir Kennington Oval is a very fine player, said my wife.","audio_seconds":4.12,"processing_seconds":4.49,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1945.265],"encode_ms":[762.219],"decode_ms":[1773.305]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0022","text":"We have heard something of your story, said Kenneth, and are interested in it.","audio_seconds":4.115,"processing_seconds":4.373,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1962.355],"encode_ms":[756.148],"decode_ms":[1647.187]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0024","text":"To be or not to be, that is the question. Whether it is no blur, you can get a little bit more than a good idea.","audio_seconds":4.1,"processing_seconds":5.709,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[35],"mel_ms":[1962.818],"encode_ms":[766.454],"decode_ms":[2969.854]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0020","text":"The goat's warlike spirit was roused by this successful attack.","audio_seconds":4.09,"processing_seconds":4.401,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1965.319],"encode_ms":[757.239],"decode_ms":[1669.067]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0035","text":"Alexander rose and shook himself angrily. Yes, I know I'm cowardly.","audio_seconds":4.075,"processing_seconds":4.429,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[28],"mel_ms":[1961.099],"encode_ms":[766.193],"decode_ms":[1692.582]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0050","text":"But there's father in the barn, sir, if he'd be of any use.","audio_seconds":4.045,"processing_seconds":4.375,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1945.026],"encode_ms":[768.662],"decode_ms":[1652.859]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-121726-0012","text":"Hussy, woman, and Bond tie.","audio_seconds":4.045,"processing_seconds":4.368,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1948.195],"encode_ms":[763.718],"decode_ms":[1647.37]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0029","text":"From the blackness behind the light they heard a voice, Warranton's.","audio_seconds":4.03,"processing_seconds":4.374,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1942.653],"encode_ms":[764.907],"decode_ms":[1656.908]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0033","text":"It was better for him to think the girl unfeeling than to know the truth.","audio_seconds":4.02,"processing_seconds":4.281,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1851.155],"encode_ms":[724.517],"decode_ms":[1696.666]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0053","text":"You haven't seen any of them? No, sir.","audio_seconds":4.015,"processing_seconds":4.071,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1856.14],"encode_ms":[728.455],"decode_ms":[1478.436]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0031","text":"On August twenty-seventh, eighteen thirty-seven, she writes.","audio_seconds":4,"processing_seconds":4.343,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[27],"mel_ms":[1897.938],"encode_ms":[727.173],"decode_ms":[1711.358]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0043","text":"The earth is not devoid of resemblance to a jail.","audio_seconds":3.99,"processing_seconds":4.157,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1865.805],"encode_ms":[727.777],"decode_ms":[1554.779]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0031","text":"It blazed up famously. Help! Help!","audio_seconds":3.98,"processing_seconds":4.105,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1850.011],"encode_ms":[728.66],"decode_ms":[1515.417]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0014","text":"Why Bannister, the servant? What's his game in the matter?","audio_seconds":3.97,"processing_seconds":4.253,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1865.516],"encode_ms":[733.147],"decode_ms":[1644.003]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0000","text":"Ojo examined this curious contrivance with wonder.","audio_seconds":3.965,"processing_seconds":4.348,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1850.553],"encode_ms":[729.129],"decode_ms":[1760.347]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0071","text":"We think that by some little work or merit we can dismiss sin.","audio_seconds":3.96,"processing_seconds":4.3,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1868.478],"encode_ms":[731.384],"decode_ms":[1691.783]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0050","text":"One of us always remains on board while the other is on shore.","audio_seconds":3.945,"processing_seconds":4.168,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1851.189],"encode_ms":[728.021],"decode_ms":[1579.758]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0024","text":"In this whole epistle, Paul treats of the resurrection of Christ.","audio_seconds":3.935,"processing_seconds":4.308,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1866.245],"encode_ms":[727.755],"decode_ms":[1704.869]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0040","text":"One thinks one hears Hydra's talking.","audio_seconds":3.925,"processing_seconds":4.099,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1859.279],"encode_ms":[681.439],"decode_ms":[1550.632]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-31957-0018","text":"But thou art not such a lover, my beloved.","audio_seconds":3.915,"processing_seconds":3.804,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1721.37],"encode_ms":[688.271],"decode_ms":[1386.652]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0023","text":"I have nothing to wear, replied that demure person.","audio_seconds":3.905,"processing_seconds":3.858,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1722.196],"encode_ms":[692.525],"decode_ms":[1435.865]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0009","text":"Paul and Apostle, not of men, etc.","audio_seconds":3.885,"processing_seconds":3.863,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1721.328],"encode_ms":[688.879],"decode_ms":[1446.711]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0032","text":"It is this that is of interest to theory of knowledge.","audio_seconds":3.88,"processing_seconds":3.828,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1725.235],"encode_ms":[691.478],"decode_ms":[1403.24]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0029","text":"To this we reply in one word only.","audio_seconds":3.87,"processing_seconds":3.892,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[11],"mel_ms":[1737.145],"encode_ms":[684.287],"decode_ms":[1463.211]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0015","text":"Since when has malady banished medicine?","audio_seconds":3.86,"processing_seconds":3.801,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1727.801],"encode_ms":[689.317],"decode_ms":[1375.711]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0049","text":"Anyone in the room could get out? Yes, sir.","audio_seconds":3.8450625,"processing_seconds":4.051,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1813.64],"encode_ms":[725.225],"decode_ms":[1504.137]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0002","text":"The head of the patchwork girl was the most curious part of her.","audio_seconds":3.835,"processing_seconds":4.121,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1860.051],"encode_ms":[732.342],"decode_ms":[1520.485]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0019","text":"After that, it was easy to forget, actually to forget.","audio_seconds":3.825,"processing_seconds":3.856,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1727.319],"encode_ms":[686.357],"decode_ms":[1434.828]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0023","text":"Alexander groaned. I meant to, but somehow I couldn't.","audio_seconds":3.805,"processing_seconds":3.922,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1724.796],"encode_ms":[696.416],"decode_ms":[1491.995]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1221-135767-0019","text":"Mother, cried she, I see you here. Look, look at that.","audio_seconds":3.78,"processing_seconds":3.906,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1727.669],"encode_ms":[689.763],"decode_ms":[1480.075]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0043","text":"Their eyes danced, Big Torleaf stood up and stretched himself.","audio_seconds":3.77,"processing_seconds":3.934,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1728.382],"encode_ms":[686.175],"decode_ms":[1511.066]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0008","text":"I suppose it's the wet season. Well, you have to cut them too.","audio_seconds":3.76,"processing_seconds":3.93,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[25],"mel_ms":[1734.232],"encode_ms":[688.431],"decode_ms":[1498.412]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3570-5694-0019","text":"But the general distinction is not on that account to be overlooked.","audio_seconds":3.755,"processing_seconds":3.958,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1716.481],"encode_ms":[684.996],"decode_ms":[1549.144]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0004","text":"He was unable to decide exactly what it should be.","audio_seconds":3.75,"processing_seconds":3.829,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1731.538],"encode_ms":[683.01],"decode_ms":[1406.803]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0044","text":"And he leaned against the wall, lost in reverie.","audio_seconds":3.74,"processing_seconds":3.907,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1725.995],"encode_ms":[691.801],"decode_ms":[1481.532]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-81414-0015","text":"I do not know. I am dazed, bewildered.","audio_seconds":3.73,"processing_seconds":3.82,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1724.362],"encode_ms":[688.011],"decode_ms":[1400.156]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0039","text":"And they are all in for this examination? Yes.","audio_seconds":3.725,"processing_seconds":3.942,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1737.955],"encode_ms":[702.834],"decode_ms":[1493.247]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123288-0022","text":"They seem to be we are lost, but I am not sure.","audio_seconds":3.705,"processing_seconds":4.152,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1862.934],"encode_ms":[731.998],"decode_ms":[1548.518]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0003","text":"It's been on only two weeks, and I've been half a dozen times already.","audio_seconds":3.7,"processing_seconds":4.282,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1888.031],"encode_ms":[727.001],"decode_ms":[1657.446]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0004","text":"In all, the novel had a difficult gestation.","audio_seconds":3.68,"processing_seconds":3.969,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1878.727],"encode_ms":[691.693],"decode_ms":[1390.722]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0017","text":"When I was a young man, I thought Paul was making too much of his call.","audio_seconds":3.665,"processing_seconds":3.994,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1777.286],"encode_ms":[693.182],"decode_ms":[1517.069]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0014","text":"They followed the jailer along a succession of passages.","audio_seconds":3.655,"processing_seconds":4.249,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1858.665],"encode_ms":[731.55],"decode_ms":[1650.123]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123440-0018","text":"I am very tired of swimming about here. Oh, mouse.","audio_seconds":3.64,"processing_seconds":4.282,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1867.811],"encode_ms":[729.082],"decode_ms":[1675.566]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"908-157963-0029","text":"Why a tongue impressed with honey from every wind?","audio_seconds":3.63,"processing_seconds":4.136,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1876.199],"encode_ms":[729.475],"decode_ms":[1522.114]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8230-279154-0008","text":"But I do not think such an inference is warranted.","audio_seconds":3.62,"processing_seconds":4.097,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1858.255],"encode_ms":[727.966],"decode_ms":[1501.852]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0025","text":"Cold is it, my darling. Bless your sweet face.","audio_seconds":3.595,"processing_seconds":4.187,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1874.915],"encode_ms":[724.262],"decode_ms":[1579.276]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0006","text":"I'm going to the court ball, answered Anders.","audio_seconds":3.58,"processing_seconds":4.302,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1868.352],"encode_ms":[730.806],"decode_ms":[1694.947]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0028","text":"Yes, yes, she hurried, pulling her hand gently away from him.","audio_seconds":3.575,"processing_seconds":4.205,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1852.825],"encode_ms":[725.868],"decode_ms":[1617.838]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0021","text":"She must care about the theater a great deal more than she used to.","audio_seconds":3.56,"processing_seconds":4.204,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1872.946],"encode_ms":[723.621],"decode_ms":[1598.167]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0007","text":"Sister Nell, do you hear these marvels?","audio_seconds":3.55,"processing_seconds":4.143,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1871.653],"encode_ms":[731.258],"decode_ms":[1531.879]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0017","text":"Worse Tom, worse than error, replied the jailer gloomily.","audio_seconds":3.545,"processing_seconds":4.447,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1879.913],"encode_ms":[737.099],"decode_ms":[1820.829]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0016","text":"Then you can ask him questions on the catechism daedalus.","audio_seconds":3.54,"processing_seconds":4.005,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1748.376],"encode_ms":[687.648],"decode_ms":[1561.011]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0019","text":"Mrs. Griffin, however, expressed the need for a little more light.","audio_seconds":3.525,"processing_seconds":3.891,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1723.288],"encode_ms":[681.594],"decode_ms":[1477.99]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1320-122612-0014","text":"The examination, however, resulted in no discovery.","audio_seconds":3.515,"processing_seconds":3.991,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1736.412],"encode_ms":[692.881],"decode_ms":[1553.826]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0034","text":"We'll be quite comfortable here, I told Conseil.","audio_seconds":3.505,"processing_seconds":3.92,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1733.091],"encode_ms":[689.449],"decode_ms":[1489.424]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0029","text":"The squire helped to thrust them all in and entered swiftly himself.","audio_seconds":3.495,"processing_seconds":4.068,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[26],"mel_ms":[1727.139],"encode_ms":[692.515],"decode_ms":[1639.875]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0023","text":"It was so dark that I could see nothing but a few sparks on the heart.","audio_seconds":3.48,"processing_seconds":3.94,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[23],"mel_ms":[1785.382],"encode_ms":[689.41],"decode_ms":[1456.91]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0003","text":"The rest of you off a Viking. He had three ships.","audio_seconds":3.47,"processing_seconds":3.885,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1741.109],"encode_ms":[682.434],"decode_ms":[1456.077]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123286-0004","text":"One might be with less reason than now.","audio_seconds":3.465,"processing_seconds":4.015,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1729.702],"encode_ms":[690.184],"decode_ms":[1587.584]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0052","text":"Oh, I would not venture to say, sir.","audio_seconds":3.45,"processing_seconds":3.812,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1749.507],"encode_ms":[688.472],"decode_ms":[1365.846]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123288-0009","text":"Those clouds seem as if they were going to crush the sea.","audio_seconds":3.435,"processing_seconds":3.909,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1718.886],"encode_ms":[683.09],"decode_ms":[1499.885]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0018","text":"I did not then realize the importance of the ministry.","audio_seconds":3.42,"processing_seconds":3.924,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1712.685],"encode_ms":[691.346],"decode_ms":[1512.65]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0022","text":"Up in the sick room, Zora lay on the little white bed.","audio_seconds":3.415,"processing_seconds":3.909,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1734.651],"encode_ms":[688.561],"decode_ms":[1477.979]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0018","text":"Do you remember that first walk we took together in Paris?","audio_seconds":3.4,"processing_seconds":3.906,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1730.793],"encode_ms":[692.995],"decode_ms":[1474.803]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294825-0019","text":"Millimeter, roughly one twenty-fifth of an inch.","audio_seconds":3.39,"processing_seconds":4.248,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1848.23],"encode_ms":[730.279],"decode_ms":[1661.122]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0035","text":"Then Lord Tuppany, well, what about auction?","audio_seconds":3.38,"processing_seconds":4.297,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1870.23],"encode_ms":[729.05],"decode_ms":[1689.102]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3575-170457-0056","text":"I doubt whether Branwell was maintaining himself at this time.","audio_seconds":3.3700625,"processing_seconds":4.156,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1874.606],"encode_ms":[726.419],"decode_ms":[1545.907]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0021","text":"Yes, sire, and ready dressed for the ballet.","audio_seconds":3.355,"processing_seconds":4.144,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1864.668],"encode_ms":[723.317],"decode_ms":[1548.461]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0006","text":"At dinner, Lake was easy and amusing.","audio_seconds":3.35,"processing_seconds":4.126,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1885.83],"encode_ms":[722.322],"decode_ms":[1509.477]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0035","text":"They remain divine regardless of men's opinion.","audio_seconds":3.335,"processing_seconds":4.34,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1872.136],"encode_ms":[731.487],"decode_ms":[1727.594]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0047","text":"How kind man is, after all, you can't do it.","audio_seconds":3.325,"processing_seconds":4.291,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1879.068],"encode_ms":[730.763],"decode_ms":[1672.786]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0032","text":"How you may be wondering, are you to begin your masterpiece?","audio_seconds":3.315,"processing_seconds":4.219,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1865.415],"encode_ms":[727.917],"decode_ms":[1617.033]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0049","text":"Here, friend, take it, and he thrust it into the farmer's hand.","audio_seconds":3.305,"processing_seconds":4.178,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[24],"mel_ms":[1866.834],"encode_ms":[723.576],"decode_ms":[1578.696]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2273-0033","text":"For a long time neither Hilda nor Bartley spoke.","audio_seconds":3.3,"processing_seconds":4.256,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1876.506],"encode_ms":[733.088],"decode_ms":[1638.5]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-81414-0003","text":"No sound broke the stillness of the night.","audio_seconds":3.295,"processing_seconds":4.278,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1868.592],"encode_ms":[722.888],"decode_ms":[1678.312]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0022","text":"I'm afraid there are no signs here, said he.","audio_seconds":3.295,"processing_seconds":4.125,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1870.629],"encode_ms":[723.642],"decode_ms":[1522.641]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-88083-0008","text":"In despair, he hurled himself downward too soon.","audio_seconds":3.28,"processing_seconds":4.116,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1863.799],"encode_ms":[729.871],"decode_ms":[1513.702]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0009","text":"Morning, girls. Hope you feel as well as you look at it.","audio_seconds":3.275,"processing_seconds":3.98,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[22],"mel_ms":[1727.155],"encode_ms":[682.971],"decode_ms":[1562.062]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0027","text":"Marie's face fell under his brooding gaze.","audio_seconds":3.27,"processing_seconds":4.02,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1746.851],"encode_ms":[689.264],"decode_ms":[1576.421]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0005","text":"Oh, that made him so angry.","audio_seconds":3.26,"processing_seconds":3.907,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1734.853],"encode_ms":[685.48],"decode_ms":[1479.202]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1089-134686-0036","text":"A great Saint Saint Francis Xavier.","audio_seconds":3.25,"processing_seconds":3.9,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1733.992],"encode_ms":[690.287],"decode_ms":[1468.842]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0004","text":"The pity that we must come and go.","audio_seconds":3.245,"processing_seconds":3.827,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[11],"mel_ms":[1723.295],"encode_ms":[689.132],"decode_ms":[1407.454]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0002","text":"Do you think so? she replied with indifference.","audio_seconds":3.235,"processing_seconds":3.97,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1729.019],"encode_ms":[682.928],"decode_ms":[1550.632]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0058","text":"A robber viking, said the king, and he scowled at me.","audio_seconds":3.225,"processing_seconds":4.155,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1736.225],"encode_ms":[719.54],"decode_ms":[1693.095]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-76324-0001","text":"There were certainly no near the solution of their problem.","audio_seconds":3.2,"processing_seconds":4.042,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1858.721],"encode_ms":[692.863],"decode_ms":[1482.555]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0013","text":"Then he looked down. The lagoon was dry.","audio_seconds":3.195,"processing_seconds":4.14,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1866.055],"encode_ms":[729.16],"decode_ms":[1536.832]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75946-0011","text":"You will take them from my private treasure.","audio_seconds":3.17,"processing_seconds":4.073,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1852.974],"encode_ms":[729.944],"decode_ms":[1481.895]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0018","text":"It truly is, asserted the magician.","audio_seconds":3.16,"processing_seconds":4.245,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1863.237],"encode_ms":[722.991],"decode_ms":[1651.203]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0020","text":"Oh yes, said Jack. And I'm nowhere.","audio_seconds":3.155,"processing_seconds":4.269,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1892.896],"encode_ms":[733.096],"decode_ms":[1634.393]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68769-0010","text":"We wish to talk with him, answered Kenneth. Talking about the What's the Well, I'm not sure what I'm saying.","audio_seconds":3.14,"processing_seconds":4.674,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[44],"mel_ms":[1870.3],"encode_ms":[730.504],"decode_ms":[2063.382]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0032","text":"Inquired Robin with his suspicion still upon him.","audio_seconds":3.135,"processing_seconds":4.281,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1885.31],"encode_ms":[732.358],"decode_ms":[1655.453]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-23283-0002","text":"said Mrs. Horton a few minutes after the first time.","audio_seconds":3.12,"processing_seconds":4.335,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1850.395],"encode_ms":[727.333],"decode_ms":[1748.81]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"260-123440-0005","text":"And yesterday things went on just as usual.","audio_seconds":3.105,"processing_seconds":4.067,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1857.529],"encode_ms":[728.418],"decode_ms":[1473.603]}
